<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">Levitikas</book>
  <para style="h">Levitikas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Levitikas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Levitikas</para>
  <para style="mt">Levitikas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a sam a, Kihoupihna puanin apan a houpih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, Na lak ua kuapeuh in thillat Toupa kiang a na lat un, gan, bawnghon leh belamhon lak a te, na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thillat pen bawnghon lak a te haltum thillat ahihleh a pa, gensiatbei a lat ding ahi. Amah Toupa ma a pom a hihtheihna ding in Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Haltum thillat lu tung ah a khut a koih dia; huchi in amah ading in lemna bawlna dia pomsak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ma ah bawngpa a gou dia; Aron tapa, siampute’n a sisan a lan ding ua, Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul a maitam sisan in a theh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Haltum thillat vun a lip dia, a sem nen ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siampu Aron tapate’n maitam ah mei a koih ding ua, mei tung ah sing a chiangkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aron tapa siampute’n sabakte, a lute leh a thaute maitam a mei tung ah sing ah kilawm tak in a koih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sungkuate leh a khete tui in a sil ding ua; siampu in Toupa adia gimlimtak, mei a lat haltum thillat ding in a pum in maitam ah a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thillat, haltum thillat ding a ganhon lak a te, belam hiam, kel hiam ahihleh a pa, gensiatbei a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maitam sik, mallam pang ah Toupa ma ah a gou dia; Aron tapa, siampute’n maitam kimvel in sisan a theh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sem ding a, a lu toh, a thau toh; siampu in maitam tung a meitung a sing tung ah a koihhoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sungkuate leh a khete tui in a sil dia; a pum in siampu in a lan dia, maitam ah a hal ding hi. Toupa adia gimlim tak, mei a lat haltum thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa adia thillat vasa lam haltum thillat ahihleh a thillat ah vakhute hiam, vapal noute hiam a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siampu in maitam ah a hontawi dia, a lu a hektan dia, maitam ah a hal ding. A sisan maitam pang ah a tak kangsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A gongkholh a mul toh a pai dia, maitam kiang, suahlam pang a meivu koihna mun ah a pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khate a bottol dia, a tak botzak lou in siampu in maitam a mei tung ah a hal ding; huai Toupa adia gimlimtak, mei a lat haltum thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Kuapeuh in thillat, tangbuang thillat Toupa kiang a lat chiang in, a thillat tangbuang nel dimdem ahi ding ahi. Sathau a buak dia, a tung ah begaw a koihlai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron tapa siampute kiang ah a paipih dia; aman a pham khat in huai a tangbuang nel dimdem, a sathau toh, a begaw tengteng toh a lakhe ding a, siampu in maitam tung ah theihgigena, Toupa adia gimlim tak, mei a thillat ding in a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat bangte Aron leh a tapate ading ahi ding. Huai Toupa adia mei a thillatte a thil siangthou tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat, a kanna a kan thillat na lat leh, tangbuang nel dimdem, sathau a mek silngou sohlouh tanghou hiam, sathau a zut, silngou sohlouh tanghou pei hiam ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thillat, kuang a kan tangbuang thillat ahihleh, silngou sohlouh, sathau a mek, tangbuang nel dimdem ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na phelkhap ding a, sathau a na buah ding ahi. Huai tangbuang thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thillat kan bel a kan, tangbuang thillat ahihleh tangbuang nel dim dem leh sathau a bawl ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai thil a bawl tangbuang thillat Toupa kiang ah na hontawi dia; siampu kiang a lat ahi dia, aman maitam ah a hon paipih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />siampu in tangbuang thillat apan theihgigena pen a lakhe dia, maitam ah a hal ding. Hiai Toupa adia gimlim tak, mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat lat bangte Aron leh a tapate a tuam ding ahi dia; hiai Toupa adia mei a thillatte lak a siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat himhim, Toupa kiang a na lat ding uh silngou soh a bawl ding ahi kei. Toupa adia mei a thillat ah silngou hiam, khuaizu himhim nahel ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gah masapen thillat bang in Toupa kiang ah na lan ding ua; gimlim dia maitam a koih ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tangbuang thillat ah na Pathian thukhun chi na maih ding ahi kei. Na thillat tengteng ah chi na lattel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gah masapen tangbuang thillat Toupa kiang a na lat leh na buh thak masapente, tangbuang thillat ding in tanghou pek na lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sathau na buak dia, a tung ah begaw na koih ding ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />siampu in huai theihgigena, buh sukzan bangzah hiam toh begaw tengteng toh a hal ding ahi. Hiai Toupa adia a mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan a thillat, lemna thillat kithoihna a hih a, bawnghon lak a a lat leh, Toupa ma ah gensiatbei a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thillat lu tung ah a khut a koih dia, Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah a gou ding. Aron tapa siampute’n maitam a sisan in a kimvel in a theh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lemna thillat kithoihna, Toupa adia mei a thillat a lan dia, a sungkua, thau leh a gilbom tengteng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kal nihte leh a tuam thau a phuk chin a om leh a sin tuam lam, a kalte toh kigawm in a suah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aron tapate’n maitam ah mei a sing om tung a haltum thillat tung ah a hal ding uhi. Hiai Toupa adia gimlim tak, mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lemna thillat kithoihna a Toupa adia a thillat belamhon lak a te ahihleh, a nu leng hita hen aw, a pa leng hita leh, gensiatbei a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thillat a, belamnou a lat leh Toupa ma ah a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thillat lu tung ah a khut a koih ding a, Kihoupihna puanin kongpi ah a gou ding. Aron tapate’n maitam a sisan in a kimvel in a theh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lemna thillat kithoihnate, Toupa adia mei a thillat a lan ding ahi. A thaute, a mei thau mahmah a tawnin, a kawngguh tan in a lavek ding a; a sungkua thaute, a gilbom tengtengte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kal nihte leh a phuk chin a om, a tuam thau leh a sin tuam a lap, a kalte nangawn toh a suah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />siampu in huai maitam ah a hal dia; hiai Toupa adia mei a thillat nekding ansiah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thillat kel ahihleh Toupa ma ah a lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lu tung ah a khut a koih ding a, Kihoupihna puanin kong ah a gou ding. Aron tapate’n maitam a sisan in a kimvel in a theh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thillat pen a lan dia, Toupa adia mei a thillat tak, a sungkua thau leh a gilbom tengteng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kal nihte leh a phuk chin a om, a tuam thau leh a sin tuam lam, a kalte toh nangawn in a suah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai siampu in maitam ah a hal ding ahi. Gimlim dia mei a thillat nekding ansiah ahi a; a thau tengteng Toupa a tuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sathau hiam, sisan hiam na ne ding uh ahi kei, chih na suante uh ading in a banban in na tenna phot uah tangtawn a thuseh ahi ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah: Toupa’n thil hihlouh ding a thu a piakte, a bangpeuh leng mi’n na hihkhial kha in, a bangpeuh leng na hihta leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thaunilh siampu in thil a hihkhelh a mipite tung a mawhpaihna a tunsak leh a thilhih khelhsa thoihna ding in Toupa kiang ah bawng tuai gensiatbei, khelh thoihna ding in lan hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawng pen Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah Toupa ma ah a honkai dia, bawng lu tung ah a khut a koih dia, Toupa ma ah huai bawng a gou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thaunilh siampu in bawng sisan bangzah hiam a la dia, Kihoupihna puanin ah a hontawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siampu in sisan ah a khut a diah dia, a khenkhat Toupa ma ah, Mun Siangthou puanzak bul ah sagihvei a theh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siampu in Toupa ma ah Kihoupihna puanin a gimlim tak maitam kite ah huai sisan bangzah hiam a tat ding ahi. Bawng sisan tengteng Kihoupihna puanin kongpi kiang a haltum thillat maitam bul ah a sungkhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khelh thoihna bawng thau tengteng, a sungkua thau leh a gilbom teng leng a lavek dia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a kal nihte leh a phuk chin a om, a tuam thau leh a sin tuam a lam, a kal nihte nangawn toh a suah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lemna thillat kithoihna bawngpa a kipan a lak bang in, siampu in haltum thillat maitam ah a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawng vunte, a sa tengtengte, a lu toh, a khete toh, a sungkuate, a ekte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a bawng pumpi toh giahphual pawlam mun siang ah, vut paihna ah a paipih dia, sing tung ah a hal ding, vut paihna a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mipi tengteng in a hihkhelh khak ua, mipi mitmuh a sel a hih a, Toupa’n hihlouh ding a thu a piakte, a bang mahmah a hih ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />siamlouh a tan ua, a thil gilou hih uh theihkhiak ahihleh, mipi in khelhthoihna ding in bawngtuai a lan ding ua, Kihoupihna puanin kong ah a honkai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite upate’n Toupa ma ah bawng lu tung ah a khut uh a koih ding ua; huai bawng Toupa ma a goh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaunilh siampu in Kihoupihna puanin ah bawng sisan bangzah hiam a hontawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siampu in huai sisan ah a khutzung a diah dia, puanzak bul ah Toupa ma ah sagihvei a theh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sisan pen Kihoupihna puanin a Toupa ma ah maitam ki ah tamlou a tat dia, sisan tengteng Kihoupihna puanin kongpi kiang a haltum thillat maitam bul ah asung khe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thau tengteng a la vek dia, maitam ah a hal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchibang in bawng pen a hih dia; khelh thoihna bawng a hih bang geih in hiai leng a hih ding ahi. Huchi in siampu in kilemna a bawl ding a, ngaihdam ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai Bawng giahphual pua ah a paipih dia, bawng masa a hal bang in a hal ding hi. Hiai mipi adia khelh thoihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaihawmtu in thil a hihkhelh a, Toupa a Pathian in hihlouh dia thu a piakte a banghiam a hihkhak a, siamlouh a tan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a thil gilou hih a theih leh a thillat ding in kelpa gensiatbei a honkai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kel lu tung ah a khut a koih dia, Toupa ma ah haltum thillat a goh zel na uah a gou ding hi. Hiai khelh thoihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siampu in khelh thoihna sisan a khutzung in tamlou a la dia, haltum thillat maitam kite ah a tat dia, haltum thillat maitam bul ah a sisan a sungkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thau tengteng, lemna thillat kithoihna thau a hal bang in maitam ah a hal ding ahi. Huchi in a khelhna tungthu ah siampu in kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vantang lak a mi, a kuamahmah in Toupa’n hihlouh dia thu a piakte a bangmah hihkhial in, siamlouh na tang leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a thil gilou hih a theih leh a thillat ding in kelnu gensiatbei, a thilhih khelhsa khelh thoihna ding in a honkai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khelh thoihna lu tung ah a khut a koih dia, haltum thillatna mun ah khelh thoihna a gou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siampu in a sisan, a khutzung in tamlou a la dia, haltum thillat maitam kite ah a tat dia, a sisan tengteng maitam bul ah a sungkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thau tengteng lemna thillat kithoihna thau a lak bang in a lavek ding hi. Siampu in Toupa adia gimlim ding in maitam ah a hal ding ahi. Huchi in siampu in kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khelh thoihna dia a thillat ding belamnou a hontawi leh, a nu, gensiatbei a hontawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khelh thoihna lu tung ah a khut a koih dia, haltum thillat a gohna uah khelhna thoihna ding in a gou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Siampu in khelh thoihna sisan a khutzung in tamlou a la dia, haltum thillat maitam kite ah a tat dia, sisan tengteng maitam bul ah asung khe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A thau tengteng, belamnou thau, lemna thillat kithoihna a lak bang in a lavek ding a, siampu in Toupa adia mei a thillat bang in maitam ah a hal ding ahi. Huchi in, siampu in a thil hihkhelhsa tungthu ah a kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, kuapeuh a thilmuh hiam, a thilzak hiam adia theihpih a hih a, kichiamsakmi aw a zak a leng gen nuamlou a, thil a hihkhelh leh a thulimlouhna mawh a paw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil sianglou himhim, gamsa sianglou luang hiam, gan sianglou luang hiam, a vak thoh ganhing sianglou luang hiam theilou a, a khoihkhak leh, sianglou leh mawhtang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing leng a sianlouhna bang peuh hi hen aw, a sianlouhna thei lou a, a khoih leh a theihkhiak hun in siamlouh a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil hoihlou hiam, thil hoih hiam hihdia, a kam a theilou a, a kichiam zialzial leh, akoi abang hitaleh, a kichiam zialzialna a theihkhiak hun in siamlouh a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, hiai thilte khat a leng siamlouh a tan chiang in a khelhna a phuang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khelh thoihna ding in belamhon lak ah a nu, belamnou hiam kel hiam, a thil hihkhelhsa man ding in Toupa kiang a lat ding a khelhna thoihna a hontawi dia; siampu in a khelh tungthu ah kilemna a bawlsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A neih in belamnou a chin zohkei leh Toupa kiang a lat ding in a khelhman ding in a khelh thoihna ding in vakhu nih hiam, vapal nou hiam a hontawi ding ahi. Khat, khelh thoihna ding in, a khat pen haltum thillat ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu kiang ah a hontawi dia, aman khelh thoihna ding in a lan masa dia, phelkhap lou in a ngawng ah a lu a hektan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khelh thoihna sisan maitam pang ah tamlou a theh dia, a sisan omlai teng maitam bul ah a tak kangsak ding hi. Hiai khelh thoihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khatpen dan dungzui in haltum thillat ding in a lan dia; siampu in a thil hihkhelhsa tungthu ah lemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh vakhu nih hiam, vapal nou nih hiam a neih zohkei leh a khelhman thillat ding leh khelh thoihna ding in tangbuang nel dimdem, ephah mun sawm a khen, mun khat a hontawi ding hi. Sathau a buak ding ahi kei a, a tung ah begaw a koih ding ahi kei; khelh thoihna a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siampu kiang ah a hontawi dia, siampu in theihgigena ding in a pham khat a la dia, maitam tung ah Toupa ading in mei a thillat bang in a hal ding ahi. Hiai tatlek thoihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai thillaka a bangmah leng a hihkhelhsa tungtang thu ah siampu in kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding. A omlai teng tangbuang thillat bangmah in siampu tantuam ahi ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil a hihkhelh a, Toupa thil siangthoute tung a a khelhkhak leh, a khelh thoihna, belamhon lak a belampa gensiatbei, Mun Siangthou sekel bang in, dangka sekel bangzah hiam gun a ngaih, tatlek kithoihna ding in Toupa ading in a honkai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil siangthou tung a a na hih diklouh khitsa pen adin dia, a mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap dia, siampu a pe ding ahi. Huchi in siampu in tatlek thoihna belampa in kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil a hihkhelh a, hihlouh dia Toupa’n thu a piakte khatpeuh ahihleh, theikei mahleh siamlouh a tang himhim dia, a thulimlouhna mawh a paw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Belamhon lak a belampa gensiatbei, a man kilawm hun, tatlek thoihna ding in siampu kiang ah a honkai ding ahi. Siampu in theiloupi a hihkhelh khak tungthu ah kilemna a bawlsak dia, ngaihdam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai tatlek thoihna ahi a; Toupa ma ah a talek mah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil hihkhial in, Toupa thu kalh in talekta leh, sum kepsak thu ah hiam, lepthu ah hiam, guktakthu ah hiam a invengte zekhem in, a invengte zuaubawl leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahihkeileh, vanmangte mu in, khem in, zuau in kichiam leh, hiai thil tengteng a khatpeuh leng a hihkhelh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a khialngei a hih a, siamlouh a tan leh a van gukte, khem a a thillakte, a kiang a kepsak sumte, vanmang a topte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />zuau a kichiamna thil bangpeuh leng a ditnawn ding ahi. A kim sipsip in a dinnawn vek dia, a mun nga a khen, mun khat val in a behlap ding. Siamlouh a tanni in a neitu a pe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tatlek thoihna, belamhon lak a, a man kilawm hun, belampa gensiatbei tatlek thoihna ding in Toupa ading in siampu kiang ah a honkai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siampu in Toupa ma ah kilemna a bawlsak ding a, Siamlouh tanna ding a thil a hih peuhmah tungthu ah, ngaihdam ahi ding a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate kiang ah, hiai haltum thillat dan ding ahi. Haltum thillat pen maitam tung a, a halna ah zankhua in a zingchiang tan in a om dia; maitam a mei a kuang nilouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siampu in a puanmalngat puansilh a silh dia, a sa khuhna ding in a puanmalngat khekol a teng dia; maitam a haltum thillat kangvute a la dia, maitam pang ah a koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A puansilh siangthou a suah dia, puansilh dang a silh dia, a vute giahphual pua munsiangthou ah a paipih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maitam tung ah mei kuansak nilouh ahi dia, a mit ding ahi kei. Siampu in zingsang teng in sing a khul dia, haltum thillat a koih hoih dia, huai ah kilemna thillatte thau a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maitam ah mei a kuang gige dia, a mit ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai tangbuang thillat dan ding ahi. Aron tapate’n maitam bul ah, Toupa ma ah a lan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman a pham khat in tangbuang thillat tung a begaw tengteng a lakhe dia, Toupa adia gimlim tak, theihgigena ding in maitam ah a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lak bangte Aron leh a tapate’n a ne ding uhi. Huai Mun Siangthou ah silngou sohlouh in a ne ding ua; Kihoupihna puanin kongtual ah a ne ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Silngou toh a kan ding uh ahi kei. Mei a ka thillat a tantuan ding ua ka piak ahi. Huai khelh thoihna leh tatlek thoihna bang a siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aron suan pasal tengteng in a nekding uh ahi. Hiai Toupa adia haltum thillat tungthu a na suante zel uh tan a tangtawn dan ahi ding. Kuapeuh hiaite khoihpeuh mah a siangthou ding uh, chi’n thu piain, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thaunilh a, a om ni ua, Aron leh a tapate’n Toupa kiang a a lat ding uh thillat hiai ahi. Tangbuang thillat dia lat zel ding, tangbuang nel dim dem ephah sawm a khen, mun khat, zingsang in a kim, nitakin a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sathau in kuangdai sung ah na kang dia, sathau a a kidiah suak khit chiang in na honla lut dia; na balnen dia, tangbuang thillat Toupa adia gimlim ding in na lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tapate lak a, a sik a pangmi, thaunilh siampu in a lan dia; tangtawn dan ding in Toupa adia haltum vek ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siampu in tangbuang thillat a lat peuhmah haltum vek ding ahi a, nek hetlouh ding ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiai khelh thoihna dan ding ahi. Haltum thillat goh zelna ah khelh thoihna leng Toupa ma a goh ding ahi. Hiai thil siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khelh thoihna lantu siampu in a ne dia; Kihoupihna puanin kongtual ah, Mun Siangthou ah a ne ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai sa khoih peuhmah a siangthou ding ahi. A sisan pen bang puan peuh a theh ahihleh, a banna peuhmah Mun Siangthou ah na sawp ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A huanna leibel pen sukkhap ding ahi. Sumbel a huan ahihleh bel nawt siang a khuah siang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasal siampu tengteng in huai a ne ding uh ahi. Hiai thil siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khelh thoihna sisan, Mun Siangthou a kilemna bawlna dia Kihoupihna puanin a hong kitawi pen nekding ahi kei, mei a haltum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in hiai tatlek thoih dan ding ahi. Thil siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Haltum thillat a gohzelna ua tatlek kithoihna leng goh ding ahi a; a sisan a maitam theh kimvel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thau tengteng a lat ding ahi. A mei thautakte, a sungkua thaute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kal nihte leh a boh thau, a phuk kiang a thau leh a sin tuam lap, a kalte nangawn in a suahkhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siampu in Toupa adia mei a thillat ding in maitam tung ah a hal ding ahi. Hiai tatlek thoihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasal siampu tengteng in a ne ding ua; Mun Siangthou a nekding ahi. Hiai thil siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tatlek thoihna pen khelh thoihna mah bang ahi a, dan khat ahi. Kilepna bawltu siampu in huai a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu, kuapeuh haltum thillat latsaktu siampu ngei in haltum thillat dia a lat vun a pum tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kanna a kan tangbuang thillat peuhmah, sikbel a kan leh kuang a kan tengteng a lantu siampu a tuam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat tengteng sathau a mek leng, a gaw leng a dang mah bang in Aron tapa tengteng a kihawm dialdial ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai pen mi’n Toupa kiang a, a lat ding, lemna thillat a kithoih dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kipahthu genna dia a lat leh kipahthu genna kithoihna ding in sathau a zut, silngou sohlouh tanghou leh sathau a zut silngou sohlouh tanghou pa didekte leh sathau a mek tangbuang nel mahmah kidiah suak a lat tel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kipahthu genna dia lemna thillat kithoihna ah tanghou silngou soh a lat tel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai a thillat teng a Toupa adia vei thillat ading in khat chiat a lan dia; lemna thillat sisan a thehtu siampu a tuam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipahthu genna dia a lemna thillat kithoihna sa pen thillat a lat ni mah a nekgaih ding ahi. A zingchiang tan a bangmah a sit ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh a thillat kithoihna pen thuchiam hiam, amah ut thu a thillat hiam ahihleh kithoihna a lat ni mah a nekding ahi a; nekbang a zing chia nekding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh kithoihna sa, a ni thum ni tan a om lailai leh hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lemna thillat kithoihna sa ni thum ni tan a a nek uleh, pom sak ahi kei dia, a lantu leng a lan a sim ahi kei ding. Thil kihhuai ahi dia, kuapeuh a ne in a thulimlouhna mawh uh a paw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil sianglou himhim toh kisukha sa nekding ahi kei, hal ding ahi. Sa siang peuhmah nekding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh lemna thillat kithoihna sa, Toupa a tuam, sianglou ne mi a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil sianglou himhim, misianglou hiam, gan sianglou hiam, thil kihhuai sianglou himhim a khoih a, lemna thillat kithoihna sa, Toupa a tuam a nek leh huai mi a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi, chi’n Aron leh a tapate houpih in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawng hiam, belam hiam, kel hiam thau na ne ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah sih a si thau leh sa balzan thau thil dang adia zat ding ahi. Na ne himhim ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuapeuh, Toupa adia mi’n mei thillat a lat uh sathau ne mi, a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tenna peuh uah sisan himhim, vasa hiam, gamsa hiam sisan hiam na ne ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kuapeuh hita leh, sisan ne himhim a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi, chi’n Israel suante houpih in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa kiang a lemna thillat kithoihna lan peuhmah in, Toupa adia a thillat, a lemna thillat kithoihna apan a honglat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa adia mei a thillat amah khut mahmah in a hontawi ding a; a thau leh a awm a honla ding ahi, a awm pen Toupa ma a vei thillat ding a vei a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siampu in maitam ah a thau a hal dia, a awm bel Aron leh a tapate a tuam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A liang taklam pen kilemna thillat kithoihna apan vei thillat dia siampu na piak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aron tapate lak a lemna thillat sisan leh thau lantu kuapeuh in a tantuan ding in a liang taklam a tang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A awm leh a liang a veilel pen uh Israel suante a lemna thillat kithoihna apan ka la tuam a, Israel suante tangtawn dan ding in siampu Aron leh a tapate ka pia ahi, chi’n Israel suante kiang ah gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hiai ahi, siampu nasem dia Toupa kiang a lat a hih nungsiah Toupa adia mei a thillat apan Aron tantuan leh a tapate tantuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amau thau a nilh ni a Israel suante’n a piak ding ua Toupa’n thu a piak. Hiai tangtawn a a suan hongom zel dingte tan a a hih dan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hiai ahi haltum thillat, tangbuang thillat, khelh thoihna leh tatlek kithoihna dan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sinai gamdai a Israel suante’n thillat Toupa kiang a a lat ding ua thu a piak ni a Sinai tang a Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron a tapate toh pi inla, puansilhte, nilhchite sathau, khelh thoihna bawngpate, belampa nihte, tanghou silngou sohlouh bawm khat toh tawi inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tengteng Kihoupihna puanin kongpi kim ah omkhawm sak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa’n thu a piak bang in a hih a; mi tengteng Kihoupihna puanin kongpi kim ah a omkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi in omkhawmte kiang ah, Hiai ahi, Toupa’n hihdia a hon thupiak pen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi in Aron leh a tapate a honpi a, tui in amau a sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puanak a silhsak a, kawnggakna in a gak a, puanaktual a silh sak a, siampu puanak in a tuam a, siampu puanak gakna siamtak a gat in a gak a, huai in a gakbelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Awmtuamna a thuah a, awmtuamna ah Urim leh Thummim a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dial a khimsak a, dial tung ah dangkaeng sikpek a bulh a, huai mailam ah Toupa’n Mosi a thupiak bang in siampu lukhu siangthou a kilhbelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi in nilhchi sathau a la a, biakbuk leh asung a thil om tengteng a nilh a, a siangthousak chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai mah in sagihvei maitam a theh a, maitam leh a tuium-belsuan tengteng, maiphiatna kuang leh a tunna siangthousak ding in a nilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua sathau Aron lu ah a buak a a siangthouna ding in a nilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi in Aron tapate a honpi a, puanak sungsilh tualte a silhsak a, kawnggakna in a gak a, Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in dial a khimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khelh thoihna bawngpa a honkai a, Aron leh a tapate’n khelh thoihna ding bawngpa lu tung ah a khut uh a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gou a; Mosi in a sisan a la a, huai maitam adia kilemna bawlna ding in a khutzung in maitam ki ah a kimvel in a tat a, maitam a siang sak a, maitam bul ah sisan asung in a siangthousak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A gilbom tengteng, a sin, a lap, a kal nihte leh a thau a la a, maitam tung ah Mosi in a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawngpa pen a vun toh, a sa toh, a ek toh giahphual pua ah a hal hi, Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Haltum thillat belampa pen a lan a, Aron leh a tapate’n belampa lu tung ah a khut uh a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A gou a, Mosi in maitam sisan in a kimvel in a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Belampa a sem a, a lu, a semnente leh a thau a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sungkua leh a khete a sil a; belampa pen maitam ah avek in a hal hi. Huai gimlim dia haltum thillat ahi a; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in TOUPA adia mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Belampa dang, hihtuamna belampa pen a hon lanawn a, Aron leh a tapate’n belampa lu tung ah a khut uh a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi in a gou a, a sisan a la a, Aron bil taklam dawn, a khut taklam khutpi leh a khe taklam khepi a nuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosi in Aron tapate a pi a, a bil taklam dawn, a khut taklam khutpi, a khe taklam khepi a nuh a, maitam sisan in a kimvel in a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thaute, a mei thau, a gilbom tengteng a sin tuampen a lapte, a kal nih leh a thau leh a liang taklam a la hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa ma a tanghou silngou sohlouh bawm apan tanghou silngou sohlouh khat leh sathau a mek tanghou pei khat leh tanghou peipa’n khat a la a, thau tung leh a liang taklam tung ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Avek in Aron khutpek tung ah leh a tapate khutpek tung ah a koih a, Toupa ma a vei thillat ding in a vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosi in a khut apan a la a, haltum thillat tung ah maitam ah a hal hi. Huai gimlim dia a hihtuamna ahi. Toupa adia mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in a awm a la a, Toupa ma a vei thillat in a vei a; hihtuamna belampa Mosi tantuam ahi, Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosi in nilhchi sathau apan tamlou leh maitam a sisan tamlou a la a, huai in Aron leh a puansilhte a theh a; a tapate leh a tapate puansilhte leng a theh hi. Aron leh a puansilh a hih siangthou a, a tapate leh a tapate puansilhte leng a hih siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi in Aron leh a tapate kiang ah, “Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah sa huan unla, Aron leh a tapate’n a nekding uh ahi, chi a thu ka piak bang in, huai ah hihtuamna bawm a tanghou toh ne uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sa leh tanghou nekbangte na hal ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na kihihtuamna ni uh a chin masiah Kihoupihna puanin kongpi pawtsan lou in ni sagih na om ding uh ahi. Ni sagih sung nou hon hihtuam ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuni a a hihsa bang in, nou adia kilemna hon bawlsak ding in Toupa’n thu a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huaiziak in Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah ni sagih, sun leh zan in na om nilouh ding ua, na sihlouhna ding ua Toupa thupiak na zuih ding uh ahi, huchibang ding a thupiak ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Mosi zang a a hih ding ua thu a piak tengteng Aron leh a tapate’n a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, a ni giat ni’n Mosi in Aron leh a tapate leh Israel upate a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron kiang ah, “Khelh thoihna ding in bawngnoupa leh haltum thillat ding in belampa gensiatbei tuaktuak kai inla, Toupa ma ah lan in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah, ‘khelh thoihna ding in kelpa, haltum thillat ding in bawngnou leh belamnou kum khat a upa tuaktuak gensiatbei tuak
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />leh bawngpa leh belampa, sathau a mek tangbuang thillat toh Toupa ma a lemna thillat a lat ding in honkai un.’ Tuni in na kiang uah Toupa a hong kilang ding hi, chi in hilh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi in thu a piak bang in Kihoupihna puanin kong ah a honkai ua; mi tengteng in a va naih ua, Toupa ma ah a va ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi in, “Hiai ahi na hih ding ua Toupa thu a honpiak, Toupa thupina na lak uah a hong kilang ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah, “Maitam honnaih inla, na khelh thoihna leh na haltum thillat lan inla, nang ading leh mipite ading in kilemna bawl in. Mipite thillat pen lan inla, amau ading in kilemna bawl in, Toupa thupiak bang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aron in maitam a vanaih a, amah a tuam khelh thoihna bawngnou a gou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aron tapate’n a kiang ah sisan a hontawi ua, huai sisan ah a khutzung a diah a, maitam kite ah a tat a, sisan pen maitam bul ah asung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh, khelh thoihna thau, a kalte leh a sin tuampen lapte maitam tung ah a hal a, Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sa leh a vun giahphual pua ah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Haltum thillat pen a gou a; Aron tapate’n a sisan a pia ua, aman maitam kimvel in a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haltum thillat sabakte leh a lu a pia ua, aman maitam ah a na hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sungkuate leh a khete a sil a, maitam ah haltum thillat tung ah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipite thillat pen a lan a, mipite khelh thoihna kel a kai a, a gou a, a ma amah bang in khelh thoihna ding in a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Haltum thillat a lan a, a dan bang in a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat a lan a, huai apan pham khat a la a, zingsang a haltum thillat chihlouh leng maitam ah a hallai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipite a tuam dia lemna thillat kithoihna bawngpa leh belampa leng a gou a, Aron tapate’n a sisan a pia ua, maitam a kimvel in a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawngpa thau leh belampa thau, a mei thau, a gilbomte, a kalte, a sin tuampen a lapte leng a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thau pen a awmte tung ah a koih a, aman a thau pen maitam ah a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A awm leh a liang taklam pen Aron in Toupa ma ah vei thillat ding in a vei hi; Mosi thupiak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aron in mipi lam ah a ban a zak a, avek un vual a zawl hi. Khelh thoihna, haltum thillat leh lemna thillat a latzoh in a hong paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron Kihoupihna puanin ah a valut ua, a hong pawtkhe nawn ua, mipite a vualzawl uhi. Toupa thupina mi tengteng kiang ah a hong kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa ma apan mei a hong pawtkhia a, haltum thillat leh thaute maitam ah a kangtumta hi. Mipi tengteng in huai a muh un a kikou zuazua ua, leisi in a khupboh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Aron tapa Nadab leh Abihute’n a meilakna uh a la tuak ua, huai ah mei am a koih ua, gimlim a buak ua, Toupa thupiak louhpi in A ma ah mei zatlouh chi a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ma apan mei a hong pawtkhia a, amau a kanglum a, Toupa ma ah a sita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah, “Kei honnaih mite ah ka siangthou ding a, mipi tengteng ma ah thupisak in ka om ding, chi a Toupa’n a gentak hiai ahi” a chi a, Aron a daidide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi in Aron pangak Usiel tapa, Misael leh Elzaphan a sam a, a kiang uah, “Mun siangthou mai apan giahphual pawlam ah na unaute uh pawkhia un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau a hong painai ua, a unaute uh a puanaktual un giahphual pawlam ah Mosi gen bang in a pawkhia uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah leh a tapa Eleazar leh Ithamar kiang ah, Na sam uh khah kei unla, na puante uh leng botkek sam kei un, huchilou in zaw na si kha ding ua; mi tengteng tung ah Toupa a thangpai kha ding. Himahleh na unaute uh leh Israel inkaw teng in ahihleh Toupa’n mei a a hih manthatte a sunthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin kongpi apan na pawt ding uh ahi kei. Huchilou in zaw na si ding uh. Toupa sathau, nilhchi na tung uah a om ngal a, a chi hi. Huchi in Mosi thu bang in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Aron a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang hiam, na tapate hiam in leng, Kihoupihna puanin sung a na lut chiang un, zu leh dawn theih hat himhim dawn kei un, huchi lou in zaw na si ding uh. Hiai na suan zelte uh tan a tangtawn thuseh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai bel a siangthou leh siangthou lou, a siang leh sianglou na khentheihna ding uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi zang a a kiang ua a gen, thupiak tengteng Israel suante na sinsak theihna ding uh ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah leh a tapa damlai Eleazar leh Ithamar kiang ah, Toupa adia mei a thillat a tangbuang thillat latbangte la unla, maitam bul ah silngou tellou in ne un; hiai thil siangthou pen ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa adia mei a thillat a nang a tuam leh na tapate a tuam a hih ziak in Mun Siangthou ah na ne ding uhi. Huchibang a thupiak a om ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A awm vei leh a liang taklam vei pen mun siang ah na ne ding uh; nang leh na tapate leh na tanute toh. Israel suante lemna thillat kithoihna nang a tuam leh na tapate adia seh ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A liang vei leh a awm vei pen Toupa ma a vei thillat dia vei ding in mei a thillat thau toh a hontawi ding uh ahi. Huai nang leh na tapate toh, tangtawn a nou a tuam ding ahi; Toupa thupiak bang in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mosi in khelh thoihna kel pen ngenteltak in a zong a, ngai dih, a na halkhin tham uh ahi a; huchi in, Aron tapa damlai, Eleazar leh Ithamar tung ah a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Bangdia khelh thoihna Mun Siangthou a nelou na hi ua? Thil siangthou, mipite thulimlouhna paw dia Toupa ma a lemna bawlsakna dia nou a honpiak ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, a sisan pen Mun Siangthou ah laklut ahi kei a, thu k’on piak bang a Mun Siangthou a na nek ngeingei ding uh eive” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aron in Mosi kiang ah, “Ngai dih, tuni in Toupa ma ah a khelh thoihna uh leh a haltum thillat uh a lan uhi. Hichibang thilte lah ka tung ah a hong omta ngal a; tuni in khelh thoihna a na neta leng, Toupa mitmuh in pom in a om dia hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosi in huai a zak in a lungkimta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih unla, leitung a gamsa tengteng lak a na nekding uh gamsa hiaite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamsa khechin nih a ka paisuak, eknel hai peuhmah na nethei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh eknel hai hiam, khechin nih a ka paisuak hiam lak ah hiaite zaw na ne ding uh ahi kei. Sangawngsau in eknel hai le leng, a chin a kat louh ziak in; nou ading in a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zupi, eknel a hai na a, himahleh a chin a katlouh ziak in nou ading in a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zusapi, eknel a hai na a, himahleh a chin a katlouh ziak in, nou ading in a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vok, a chin a ka paisuak na a, himahleh eknel a hailouh ziak in; nou a di’n a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sa uh na ne ding uh ahi kei, a luang uh leng na khoih ding uh ahi kei, nou ading in a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui sung a tengte lak ah hiaite na ne thei ding uh: Tuipite leh luite a om kha leh lip nei photphot na nethei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuisung a tengte leh tui a thilhing om tengteng lak ah tuipi a te, lui a te, kha leh lip neilou photphot nou ading in thil kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou ading in thil kihhuai ahi ding ua; a sa uh na ne ding uh ahi kei. A luangte uh thil kihhuai a na neih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tui a kha leh lip neilou photphot zaw nou ading in thil kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vasa lak ah hiaite thil kihhuai a na neih ding uh ahi a; nekding ahi kei. Thil kihhuai ahi uh: muvanlai, musane leh tuivapi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muvompi leh musi chi himhimte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Va-ak leh a chi himhimte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simbu, vabak, tuipi vasate leh mu chi himhimte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Simbutanglip, ngagal leh simbupi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuivapi, vabukngak leh musanepi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Intung va, dil vasa leh a chi himhim, huihtun leh bakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kha nei khe li a pai chi peuhmah nou ading in thil kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh a leng thei ganhing neu pawl khat na nektheih ding uh a om. Huaite ahihleh leilak a tomthei kheguh tang neite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiaite lak a na nek theih dingte uh, Khaupe chi himhim, kelkum, khuangbai ahihkeileh khaukhup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh kha nei, khelinei dangte peuhmah nou ading in kihhuai ahivek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiaite ziak in sianglou na suakthei uhi. Kuapeuh hiai ganhing sianglou sisa toh kisukha peuhmah nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai luang lami peuhmah in a puante uh a sawp ding uh ahi, nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gamsa chin ka paisuak lou, eknel leng hailou chi tengteng nou ading in a sianglou ahi ua; kuapeuh huaite khoih sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bokvak a pai tengteng lak a khebom a pai peuh mahte nou ading in a sianglou ahi a; a luang uh khoih peuhmah nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A luang lami peuhmah in a puante a sawp ding ahi, nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding a; nou ading in a sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lei a vakthoh chi lak a nou adia sianglou hiaite ahi: Bui, chikpi, thankikpi leh a chi himhim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Inhik, tangteuh, thankik, dokdawn leh zusa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A vak thoh chi tengteng lak a nou adia sianglou hiaite ahi uh. Kuapeuh hiaite sisa a khoih uleh nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A sih ua bang peuh a delhkhum uh, a sianglou ahi dia; vanzat photphot sing a bawl tuium-belsuan hiam, puan hiam, savun hiam, sai ip hiam leng tui a diah ding ahi a; nitaklam tan in a sianglou ahi ding. Huaikhit in a hong siang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kiakna peuh leibel chih na hihtam ding uh ahi, asung a om tengteng a sianglou ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huai bel a nekchi om tengteng leh huai a om tui a diahsa himhim sianglou ahi dia; dawn chi, dawntheih chi tengteng leng huai bel sung a om himhim sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thil bangpeuh a siluang a kahiang khatpeuh in a delhkhum phot sianglou ahi zel dia; tanghou kanna hiam, kan lumna bel hiam leng hihtap vek ding ahi, sianglou ahi khin a, nou ading in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Himahleh tuikhuk hiam, tuibem, tui tamtak omna sianglou chih a omkei a, himahleh a siluang in a sukkhak peuhmah a sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chin ding haichi himhim zaw siluang in banglai peuh in delhkhumta leh a sianglou kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh haichi, tui a diahsa siluang in koilai peuh a delh khak leh nou ading in sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Gamsa na nektheih chi himhim u leng a sih leh a luang khoih mi peuhmah nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A sa ne peuhmah in a puante uh a sawp ding uh ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding. A luang lami in leng a puante a sawp ding ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ganhing leitung a bokvak chi tengteng thil kihhuai ahi ua, nekding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kitholh chi leh khe li a pai chi hiam, khe tampi nei chi hiam, leitung a bokvak chi himhim na ne ding uh ahi kei, thil kihhuai ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A bokvak chi himhim in na kihihthanghuai ding uh ahi kei, hiaite in na kihihbuah ding uh ahi kei, huaite in sianglou in na kibawl ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi ngal a; huaiziak in, kisiangsak unla, siangthou in om un; kei lah ka siangthou ngal a. Leitung a teng, a bok a vak, a bangchi mah in kihihbuah kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na Pathian uh hi ding a Aigupta gam a kipan nou hon pikhia Toupa lah ka hi ngal a. Kei ka siangthou a, huaiziak in, nou leng na siangthou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hiai pen gamsa leh vasate leh tui a teng chi thilhing chiteng leh lei a bokvak chitengte tungthu a dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A siang leh sianglou khenna ding leh gamsa nektheih chi leh gamsa nek theihlouh chi khenna ding in, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah: Numei in nau a pai a, tapa a neih leh ni sagih sung sianglou ahi dia; numei dan ngeina hunlaia a sianlouh bang in sianglou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n a tapa zekmong vun a sum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sisan ziak a kisiangsak in ni sawmthum leh thum a omlai ding ahi. A kisiansak ni a kim mateng thilsiang himhim a khoih ding ahi kei a; Mun Siangthou ah leng a lut ding ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nau numei a neih leh bel numei dan ngeina hunlaia a sianlouh bang in nipikal nih sung sianglou ahi dia, sisan ziak a kisiangsak in ni sawmguk leh guk a omlai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tapa hiam, tanu hiam ziak a kisiansak ni a kimchiang in haltum thillat ding in belamnou kum khat a upa leh khelh thoihna ding in vapal nou hiam, vakhu hiam Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah siampu kiang ah a hontawi ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman Toupa ma ah a lan ding a, kilemna a bawlsak dia, huchi in a sisan pawtna apan a siang ding. Hiai pen pasal hiam, numei hiam neinu adia dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A neih in belamnou a chin kei leh vakhu kopkhat hiam, vapal nou kopkhat hiam a tawi ding ahi: Khat haltum thillat ding in, a khat pen khelh thoihna ding in. Siampu in kilemna a bawlsak dia, huchi in a hong siangta ding, chi in gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi vun a, a khem hiam, a bol hiam a, phak hileh kilawm a kimuh leh siampu Aron kiang ah hiam, a tapa siampute lak a kuapen hiam kiang a pi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siampu in a vun a hi pen a na en dia, a hi omna a mul a kan a, a hi pen a vun sang a thuk zaw a a kimuh leh phak ahi a, siampu in amah a na en ding a, mi sianglou in a phuang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A vun a bolte a kan a, a vun sang a thukzaw a a kimuh kei leh, a mul a kan kei leh hi neimi pen siampu in ni sagih sung a khum tuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siampu in ni sagih ni’n amah a endia; ngai dih, a hi pen a ngeingei a a muh a, a hi pen a vun a a zamzak kei leh siampu in ni sagih mah a khumtuam nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siampu in ni sagih ni’n a en nawn dia; ngai dih, hi pen a mial a, hi pen a vun a a zamzak kei leh siampu in a siang chih a phuang ding ahi. A khem lel ahi a, a puante a sawp dia, a hong siang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh a siansakna dia siampu a kietsak nung a a khempen a vun a a zamzak mahmah leh siampu a kiensak nawn ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu in a en dia, ngai in, a khempen a vun a a zamzak leh siampu in sianglou chih a phuang dia, hiai phak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi’n phak hi a vom leh siampu kiang a pi ding ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siampu in a na en dia, ngai dih, a vun a a kang a omkhiak a, a mul a kansak a, a bawk dulh hethut leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sa a phak kumlui om ahi a, siampu in a sianglou ahi chih a phuang dia, himahleh amah sianglou a hih ziak a khumtuam ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A phakpen a vuna a zamzak mahmah a, a hi veimi vun, a lu apan a khe tan a siampu theihchiang phak in a bop leh, siampu’n a en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai dih, phak in a sa tengteng a bop suaksa ahihleh, hi veimi a siang chih a phuang dia, a kangkhinta a, a siangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh a sa a dulh hethut leh, a sianglou ahi dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siampu in a sa dulh hethut a en dia, sianglou in a phuang ding hi. Sa dulh hethut pen sianglou ahi a, phak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh sa dulh hethut pen a na lamdan nawn a, a na kan nawn leh siampu kiang ah a hoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siampu in a na en dia; ngai dih, a hi a kan leh siampu in hi veimi a sianglou kei chih a phuang ding hi. Amah a siangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sa leh a vun a om meimatum ahi a, a damta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A meimatum omna mun a na kan a na san hiam, kang sandeuh a na bol hiam ahihleh, siampu in a et ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siampu in a na en dia, ngai dih, a vun sang a thuka a kimuh a, a mul a kan leh siampu in sianglou in a phuang ding ahi: phak hi ahi a, meimatum a hong suakkhia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh siampu in a na et a, ngai dih, mul kang a omlouh a, a mialsim phet ahihleh, siampu in ni sagih a khumtuam ding a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A vun a a zamzak leh siampu in sianglou in a phuang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh a bol ngou pen a omna ngei a om a, a zamzak kei leh meimatum pawn lel ahi a; siampu in a siangthou chih a phuang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihkeileh a vun polna mun a sa a om a, a kang hiam, a san sim hiam ahihkeileh a ngou leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siampu in a na endia, ngai dih, a polna laitak a mul pen a kan a, huchi a vun sang a thukzaw a a kimuh leh phak ahi a, meikat a hong omkhia phak ahi a, siampu in sianglou in a phuang ding ahi, hiai phak hi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh siampu in a na et a, ngai dih, a pol a mulkang omlou a, a vun sang a thuklou zaw a, mialdeuh lel ahihleh siampu in ni sagih a khum tuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siampu in ni sagih ni’n amah a en dia, a vun a a zamzak mahmah leh siampu in a sianglou in a phuang ding hi, hiai phak hi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A polpen a omna ngei a a na omdet a, vun a a zamzak kei leh, mialdeuh lel ahihleh meikat bawklel ahi a, siampu in a siang chih a phuang ding ahi; meikang pawn lel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Numei hiam, pasal hiam in a lu ah hiam, a khamul lak ah hiam hi a vei leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siampu in hi pen a na en dia; ngai dih, a vun sang a thukzaw a a kimuh a, a mul eng ngattak om leh siampu in sianglou in a phuang ding ahi; meimasungtum ahi a, a lu hiam a khamul hiam phak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siampu in meimasungtum hipen a et a, ngai dih, a vun sang a thuklou zaw a a kimuh a, a mul vom a omkei leh siampu in meimasungtum hi veimi pen ni sagih a khumtuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ni sagih ni’n siampu in hi a en dia, ngai dih, meimasungtum a zamzak louh a, mul eng a omkei leh, meimasungtum a vun sang a thukzaw a a kimuh kei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />met ding ahi a, meimasungtum laitak bel a met ding ahi kei; siampu in meimasungtum neimi ni sagih dang a khumtuam nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ni sagih ni’n siampu in meimasungtum a en nawn dia; ngai dih, meimasungtum pen a vun a a zaklouh a, a vun sang a thukzaw a a kimuh kei leh, siampu in siang in a phuang ding ahi. Huchi in a puante a sawp dia, a hong siangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Himahleh meimasungtum pen a ki siansak nung a, a vun a a zamzak mahmah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siampu in amah a na endia, ngai dih, meimasungtum pen a vun a, a zamzak leh, siampu ading in mul eng zon a kiphamoh chitchiat kei ding; amah sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Himahleh meimasungtum pen a ngeingei a a muh a, mul vom a pou leh, meimasungtum a damta ahi a, amah a siang a, siampu in a siang, chih a phuang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Numei hiam, pasal hiam, a vun ah pol, pol ngou kilhkelh a na om leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siampu in a en dia, ngai dih, a vun a pol pen mialngou simlel ahihleh pollel ahi a, vun a hongsuak ahi a, amah a siang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A sam pulhsiangmi lugiau ahi; himahleh amah a siang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A sipsam a pulh siang leh talngalh ahi a, himahleh amah a siang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Himahleh lugiau hiam, talngalh hiam ah, hi sansim a ngou a om leh, a lugiau hiam, a talngalh hiam phak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi in siampu in a na en dia, ngai dih, a lugiau hiam, a talngalh hiam a hi hong bawkkhia pen a sansim leh ngousim hethut a, a vun a phak bang a kimuh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amah phak ahi a, sianglou ahi. siampu in sianglou a phuan ngeingei ding ahi, phakna a lu ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Phak hi veimi puante bohkek ahi dia, a samte khah ahi dia, a muk tunglam a tuam dia, sianglou, sianglou, chi in a kikou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Phak in a bop sungteng sianglou ahi dia; sianglou ahi a, a tengtuam dia; giahphual pua ah a teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Phak hi omna puansilh, samul puan hiam, khau zangngat puan hiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />a gat thoh hiam, a phanthoh hiam; khau zangngat hiam, samul hiam, savun hiam, bangpeuh savun a bawl ah hiam; savun hiam, bangpeuh savun a bawl ah hiam, savun hiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Gat ah hiam, phan ah hiam, bangpeuh savun a bawl ah hiam a hingsim hiam a a dawkkhiak leh, phak hi ahi a, siampu in a en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Siampu in hi a en dia, hi omna ni sagih a khumtuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ni sagih ni’n hi a en dia, hi pen puansilh, gat ah hiam, phan ah hiam, savun ah hiam, bang ding peuh a leng a zat uh savunte ah hiam, a zam leh hipen phakkip mahmah chi ahihleh sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Puansilh, gat hiam, phan hiam, samul hiam, khau zangngat hiam, savun a bawl chi himhim hiam, phak omna peuhmah hal ding ahi, phakkip mahmah chi ahi ngal a, hal ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Siampu in a na et a, huchi a, ngai dih, puansilh, gat hiam, phan hiam, savun a bawl chi himhim ah leng hipen a zamkei leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />hi omna siampu in sawp ding thu a pedia, ni sagih dang a khumtuam nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hi omna sawp a hih khitnung in siampu in a na ennawn dia, ngai dih, huai hi latdan a kikhek kei leh hipen zamkei mahleh, a siang tuankei, mei a na hal ding ahi; a kip chi ahi, a sunglam hiam, a pawlam hiam a giau leh leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Siampu in a na et a, huchi a, ngai dih, sawpkhit nung a mial sim lel ahihleh puansilh apan hiam, savun apan hiam, gat apan hiam, phan apan hiam a botkhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Puansilh pen, gat ah hiam, phan ah hiam, savun bawl ah hiam a latlai lai leh a hong pawtnawn ahi a; hi omna pen na hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Puansilh, gat hiam, phan hiam, bangpeuh savun a bawl chi himhim hiam na sawp a, hi in a nutsiat leh sawpnawn ding ahi a, huchi in a hong siangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Hiai bel, puansilh samul hiam, khau zangngat hiam, gat hiam, phan hiam, savun a bawl chi himhim hiam a phak hi om a sian leh sianlouh phuanna dan ding ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai phak siansak ni a hihdan ding ahi. siampu kiang a pi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in siampu giahphual pua ah a paikhe dia; siampu in a en dia, ngai dih, phakmi pen a phakna hi a dam leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampu in a kisiangsak ding mi vasa hing siang nih, sidar sing, khauzang san leh hussop tawisak ding in thu a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siampu in vasa khat pen leibel ah luitui tung ah goh ding in thu a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vasa hing pen a la dia, sidar sing, khauzang san, hussop toh luitui luang tung a gohsa vasa sisan ah a diahvek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Phakna apan a kisiangsak ding mi sagihvei a theh dia, a siang chih a phuang ding, huchi in vasa hing pen gamlak ah a khah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kisiangsak ding mi’n a puante a sawp dia, a kimetmai vek dia, a kisil ding ahi. Huchi in a hong siang dia, huaikhit chiang in giahphual ah a hoh dia, himahleh a puanin pua ah ni sagih a omlai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a ni sagih ni’n a lu a sam tengteng leh a khamul leh a mitkhu multe a metmai dia, a mul tengteng a metmai ding hi. A puante a sawp in a kisil dia, huchi in a hong siangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n belamnoupa nih gensiatbei leh belamnounu khat gensiatbei, kum khat a upa leh tangbuang thillat ding in tangbuang nel mahmah ephah mun sawm a khen, mun thum sathau a mek leh sathau thawl khat a tawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A siangsakpa siampu in kisiangsak ding mi leh huai thilte Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah Toupa ma ah a koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siampu in belamnoupa khat pen sathau log khat toh a la dia, tatlek thoihna ding in a lan dia, Toupa ma a vei thillat ding in a vei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khelh thoihna leh haltum thillat a goh zelna mun uh, Mun Siangthou ah belamnoupa pen a gou dia, khelh thoihna siampu a tuam ahihbangin tatlek thoihna leng siampu a tuam ahi; hiai thil siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siampu in tatlek thoihna sisan a la dia, kisiangsak ding mi bil taklam mongte, a khut taklam khutpite, a taklam khepite siampu in a nuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sathau log khat pen siampu in a la dia, amah khutpek veilam ah asung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siampu in a khut veilam a sathau ah a khut taklam zung a diah ding a, Toupa ma ah a khutzung in sathau sagihvei a theh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khut a sathau omlai teng in kisiangsak ding mi bil taklam dawn, a khut taklam khutpi leh a khe taklam khepi ah tatlekna kithoihna sisan tung ah a nuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siampu in a khut a omlai teng in kisiangsak ding mi lu a nuh dia; huchi in siampu in Toupa ma ah kilemna a bawlsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siampu in khelh thoihna a lan dia, a sianlouhna apan kisiang sak ding mipen kilemna a bawlsak dia; huaikhit in haltum thillat a gou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siampu in haltum thillat leh tangbuang thillat maitam ah a lat ding a siam a, siampu in kilemna a bawlsak ding a, huchi in a hongsiang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mizawng a hih a, hiaite a neihzoh kei leh, belamnoupa khat tatlek thoihna, kilemna bawl sakna dia vei ding leh tangbuang thillat dia tangbuang nel mahmah ephah mun sawm a khen, mun khat, sathau a zut, sathau log khat toh a tawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vakhu kop khat hiam, vapal nou kop khat hiam, a neihzoh lamlam; khat khelh thoihna ding, khat pen haltum thillat ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n a kisiansakna ding in siampu kiang ah Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah Toupa ma ah a hontawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in siampu in tatlek thoihna belamnou leh sathau log khat a la dia, vei thillat ding in Toupa ma ah siampu in a vei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tatlek thoihna belamnou pen a gou dia; siampu in tatlek thoihna sisan a la dia, kisiangsak ding mi bil taklam dawn, a khut taklam khutpi leh a khe taklam khepi a nuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siampu in sathau amah khutpek veilam ah asung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siampu in a khut veilam a sathau khenkhat a khut taklam in Toupa ma ah sagihvei a theh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siampu in a khut a sathau in kisiangsak ding mi bil taklam dawn, a khut taklam khutpi, a khe taklam khepi leh tatlek kithoihna sisan tungtak ah a nuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siampu in a khut a sathau om laiteng in Toupa ma a kilemna bawlsak ding in kisiangsak ding mi lu a nuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vakhu hiam, vapal nou hiam, a neihzoh lamlam khat a lan dia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a neihzoh lamlam, khelh thoihna ding in khat, haltum thillat ding in khat, tangbuang thillat toh. Huchi in siampu in kisiangsak ding mi ading in Toupa ma ah kilemna a bawlsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiai bel phak hivei, kisiansakna dan bang a chinloute adia dan ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Luah dia k’on piak Kanan gam na lut chiang ua, na luah ding uh gam a inn khat a phak hi ka koih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai inn neitu in, hiai inn ah hi hileh kilawmtak om leh kilawm ka sa, chi in siampu a honghilh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siampu in hi a en dia, a lut ma in inn sung hihvuak ding in siampu in thu a pedia, hiai insung a thil om tengteng sianglou ahi ding hi; huai nung in siampu inn sung en ding in a lut ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman hi a en dia, ngai dih, hi in a hinglam sim hiam a sanlam sim hiam a bang a nekkuak a, bang sang a niam zaw a a kimuh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Siampu inn apan kongpi ah a pawt dia, ni sagih sung huai inn a khak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ni sagih ni’n siampu’n inn a va en nawn dia, ngai dih, hi pen huai inn bang a a na zamzak leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Siampu in huai hi omna suangpen lakhia a, khopi pawlam a ninpaihna mun a paih ding in thu a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />inn sung lam a kiat siang kimvel sak dia, suang zutbitna a kiat khiak leivui pen dainawl mun nin ah asung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Suang dang a la ding ua, huai suangte mun ah a koih ding ua; suang zutbitna dang a la ding ua, inn a hu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Suang a lakkhiak a, inn a kiat siang a, a hukkhit nung a hi a hong dawk nawn leh, siampu a valut dia, a va en nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai dih, hi a na zamzak leh huai inn a phak a kip chi ahi a, sianglou ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huai inn a phel dia, a suang, a sing leh a suang zutbitna teng leng dainawl mun nin ah a nawn khevek ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai inn khak ahihsung himhim a lut taphot nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai inn a lum taphot in a puante uh a sawp ding ua; kuapeuh huai inn a an neta phot in a puante uh a sawp ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Siampu a lut a, a etkimvel a, ngai dih, huai inn huk hoih a hih nung a, hi a zamzak kei leh, inn a siang chih siampu in a phuang ding, hi pen a ki khinmang tak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />inn siansakna ding in vasa nih leh Sidar sing leh khauzang san leh hussop a tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Vasa khat pen lei bel ah luitui luang tung ah a gou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Sidar sing, hussop, khausan leh vasa hing pen a la dia, vasa gohsa sisan ah leh luitui ah a diah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Vasa sisan, luitui luang, vasa hing pen, sidar sing, hussop leh khausan in huai inn a siangsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vasa hing pen khua apan gamlak ah kilemna bawlna ding in a leng khesak dia; huchi in huai inn a siangsak ding a, a hong siang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hiai pen phak hi chichih leh meimasungtum tungthu a dan ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />puan a om leh innte a om phak ading;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />chibawk, khem, pol leh chikang chihte toh kisai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />sianlouhna hun leh sianna hun a sinsak ding, phak dan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih unla, a kiang uah, Mi kuapeuh sa a thil a pawt leh a thilpawt ziak in sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thilpawt sungteng sianglou ahi a, a sa ah a pawt gige hiam, a pawt a tawpta hiam leng hitaleh, amah sianglou himhim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thilpawt mi lupna peuhmah sianglou ahi dia; a tutna peuhmah leng sianglou ahilai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuapeuh a lupna khoih peuhmahte’n a puante uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thilpawt mi tutna a tu peuhmahte’n a puante uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuapeuh thilpawt mi sa khoih peuhmah in a puante uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thilpawt mi in mi sianglou chil a siatkhum leh a puante a sawp dia, a kisil ding ahi, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuanna bangpeuh a leng thilpawtmi a tuan leh sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuapeuh a kingaihnasa nung thilkhoih peuhmahte nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding ua; huai thil lasuan mi peuhmah in a puante uh a sawp ding ua; a kisil ding uh ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuapeuh thilpawt mi in a khut sillou a a khoih peuhmah in a puante a sawp dia, a kisil ding ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thilpawt mi leibel khoihsa suktap ding ahi; a sing vanzat tengteng silsiang vek ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilpawtmi bel, a thilpawt hihsiang ahihleh, a ki siansakna ding in ni sagih a kipe dia, a puante a sawp dia; luitui ah a kisil dia; huchi in a hong siangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n vakhu kopkhat hiam, vapal nou kopkhat hiam tawi in Toupa ma ah Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah a hoh dia, siampu a pe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siampu in khelh thoihna ding in khat, haltum thillat ding in a khat pen a lan ding hi. Siampu in a thilpawt thu ah Toupa ma ah kilemna a bawlsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasal kuapeuh kipolhna chi amah apan a pawt leh a pumpi in a kisil vek dia, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puansilh leh vun, kipolhna chitukna peuhmah sawpsiang vek ding ahi a, nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei a luppih leng a nih ua a kisil tuak ding uh ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei in thilpawt a neih a, a sa a thilpawt si ahihleh ni sagih sung sianglou ahi dia; kuapeuh amah khoihkha taphot nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sianlouh sung a, a lupna peuhmah sianglou ahi dia, a tutna peuhmah leng sianglou ahilai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A lupna khoih peuhmahte’n a puante uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kuapeuh a tutna khoih peuhmahte’n a puante uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lupna a thil om hiam, a tutna a thil om hiam khoih peuhmah leng nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kuapeuh in a luppih a, a sineih luang in amah a sukkhak leh ni sagih sung sianglou ahi dia; a lupna peuhmah sianglou ahivek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei a sineih ngeina hilou, ni sawtkuam tak a sipawt hiam, a nitdan ngeina sang a sawtzaw sipawt hiam ahihleh, a sianlouh dan ngeina sung a, a om zel bang in sipawtmi a nit sungteng sianglou in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sipawt sungteng a lupna taphot a sianglouh ngeina hunlai a, a lupna bang ahi dia; a tutna peuhmah a sianlouh ngeina hunlai a, a sianglouh bang in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai thil khoih peuhmah sianglou ahi dia, a puante a sawp dia, a kisil ding ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh a sipawt pen siansak ahihleh ni sagih aman a kisim dia, huchi in a hong siangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni giat ni’n vakhu kopkhat hiam, vapalnou kopkhat hiam a tawi dia, Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah siampu a hong pe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siampu in khelh thoihna ding in khat, haltum thillat ding in khat a lan ding ahi. Huchi in siampu in sipawt mi a sianlouhna thu ah Toupa ma ah kilemna a bawlsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hiai bang in Israel suante a sianlouhna ua pan na hihtuam ding uh ahi, a lak ua ka biakbuk a hihbuah khak chiang ua leng a sianglouhna ua a sihlouhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiai dan pasal thilpawt neimi leh kipolhna apan chi pawtkhia a ninte leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />numei kha teng sineih sung ading, pasal hi in numei hitaleh sa apan thilpawt neimi ading leh sianglou a ngaih numei luppih pasal ading ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Aron tapa nihte’n Toupa a va naih ua a sihloh nung un Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah: Na unau Aron houpih inla, puanzak sung Mun Siangthou ah, bawm tung a chitna tutphah ma ah chiklaipeuh in leng honglut hetkei heh, a si kha ding hi. Chitna tutphah tung a, meipi a hong kilang ding ka hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichibang in Aron Mun Siangthou ah khelh thoihna ding in bawng tuai, haltum thillat ding in belampa toh a hoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puanmalngat puanak siangthou a silh dia, a sa khuhna ding in puanmalngat pheitawm a bun ding, puanmalngat dial a khim ding ahi. Hiaite puansilh siangthou ahi a; a kisil masa dia, huchi in a silh phet ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel suan mipi hon apan khelh thoihna ding in kelpa nih leh haltum thillat ding in belampa khat a tawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aron in amah a tuam, khelh thoihna bawngpa pen a lan dia, amah leh a inkawte ading in kilemna a bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kel nih a kai dia, Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah Toupa ma ah a koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aron in kel nih tungthu ah ai a san dia, khat Toupa a tuam ahi dia, a khat pen thuaksik thuak kel ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aron in Toupa a tuam dia puk kel pen a la dia, khelh thoihna ding in a lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuaksik thuak kel dia puk pen kilemna bawlna dia khah ding in Toupa ma ah a hing in a koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aron in a ma a tuam khelhna bawngpa pen a la dia, amah leh a inkawte ading in kilemna a bawl dia, amah a tuam khelh thoihna bawngpa pen a gou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa ma a maitam apan meilakna dim in mei am a la dia, gimlim gawizan ngiingei pham khat toh puanzak sung ah a lutpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gimlim khu in thu theihpihna tung a chitna tutphah a bopna ding in Toupa ma a mei ah gimlim a buak dia, sihna a tuahlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngpa sisan bangzah hiam a la dia, a khutzung in chitna tutphah suahlam pang a theh dia, a khut in chitna tutphah bul sisan in sagihvei a theh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipi a tuam khelhthoihna kel pen a gou dia, a sisan, bawngpa sisan a bawl bang in a bawl dia, chitna tutphah tung leh chitna tutphah ma ah a theh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel suante sianlouhnate leh a khelhnate ua a tatleknate uh ziak in Mun Siangthou ading in kilemna a bawl ding hi. Huai mah bang in, a sianlouhnate uh lak a om, Kihoupihna puanin ading in leng a bawlsam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mun siangthou a kilemna bawl dia a lut lai in, amah leh a inkawte leh Israel mipite adia kilemna bawlkhin a a hongpawt khiak masiah kuamah puanin sung ah a om ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa ma a maitam lam ah a pawt dia, huai ading in kilemna a bawl dia, bawngpa sisan leh kel sisan bangzah hiam a la dia, maitam kite ah a kimvel in a tat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khut in huai sisan sagihvei a theh dia, a siangsak dia, Israel suante sianglouhna apan a hih siangthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mun siangthou leh Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam adia kilemna a bawlkhit chiang in, kel hingpen a honkai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aron in kel hing lu tung ah a khut langnih a koih dia, a tung ah Israel suante gitlouhna teng leh khiala a tatlekna teng uh a pulak dia; huaite kel lu tung ah a nga dia, mi khat a sehkholhsa un gamdai ah a pimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai kel in a gitlouhna tengteng uh luahlouh gam ah a paw mang dia, kel bel gamdai ah a khah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin ah Aron a lut dia, Mun Siangthou a, a lutlai a puanmalngat puansilh a suah dia, huai ah a nuse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mun siangthou ah a kisil dia, a puansilh a silh dia, a hong pawtkhe dia, amah a tuam haltum thillat leh mipi a tuam haltum thillat a lan dia, amah leh mipi ading in kilemna a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khelh thoihna thau maitam ah a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuaksik thuak kel khah mi kuapeuh in a puante a sawp dia, a kisil dia, huaikhit in a omna mun ah a pai nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khelh thoihna bawngpa leh khelh thoihna kel sisan kilemna a bawlna dia Mun Siangthou a, a lutpih uh giahphual pua ah a paipih ding hi; a vun, a sa leh a ek a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hal mi’n a puan a sawp dia, a kisil dia, huaikhit in a omna mun ah a pai nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai na tangtawn dan ding uh ahi: A kha sagihna, huai kha ni sawm ni’n na lungsimte uh na gimsak ding ua, na gam ua mi himhim hiam, gamdangmi na lak ua teng hiam in bangmah a seplouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiai ni’n noute hihsiangthou ding in noute ading in kilemna bawl ahi dia; huchi in Toupa ma ah na khelhna tengteng lak ua pan na siang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nou adia Sabbath khawlni ahi a, na lungsimte uh na gimsak ding uh. Hiai tangtawn dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Siampu, a pa sik a siampu hidia sathau nilh ding leh hihtuam mi hi ding in kilemna a bawl dia, puanmalngat puansilh siangthou a silh dia; Mun Siangthou ading in kilemna a bawl dia; Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam ading in leng kilemna a bawl sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Siampute leh mipi hon ading in kilemna a bawl nawnlai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khelhna tengteng uh ziak a kumchih a khatvei Israel suante adia kilemna bawl na tangtawn dan ding uh ahi, a chi hi. Huchi in Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate leh Israel suan tengteng houpih inla, a kiang uah: Hiai Toupa thupiak ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel inkawte lak a mi bawngpa hiam, belamnou hiam, kel hiam giahphual hiam, giahphual pawlam hiam a gou a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa biakbuk ma a Toupa adia a thillat dia Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul a hon tawilou peuhmah, huai mi sisan suah a ngaih ahi ding; sisan suah ngei ahi, huai mi a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai pen Israel suante’n a kithoihnate uh, gamlak a kithoihnate uh a honlak ua, Toupa ading ngei a Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul a, siampu kiang a, a hontawi ua, Toupa adia lemna thillat kithoihna a hih theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />siampu in Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul a maitam sisan in a theh dia, a thau Toupa ading in gimlimtakin a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A angkawmna uh dawite kiang ah a kithoih nawn ding uh ahi kei. Hiai a suante uh tan a tangtawn a dia dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiang uah, Israel inn kaw mi himhim hiam, gamdangmi a lak ua tengte hiam in haltum thillat hiam, kithoihna hiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa kiang a kithoihna dia Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul a hon tawilou a om leh huai mi a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuapeuh Israel inn kaw lak a mi hiam, gamdangmi a lak ua teng hiam, bang sisan leng ne peuhmah, huai sisan nemi tung ah ka mai ka gumsak dia, a chipihte lak apan satkhiat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sa hinna pen sisan a a om ziak in, Na hinna uh adia kilemna bawlna dia maitam tung a nou k’on piak ahi. Hinna dia kilemna bawlna pen sisan mahlah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Israel suante kiang ah, Kuamah in sisan na ne ding uh ahi kei. Gamdangmi na lak ua teng in leng sisan a ne ding ahi kei, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel suante lak a mi hiam, gamdangmi a lak ua teng hiam, gam vavak a, sa hiam, vasa hiam, nektheih chi a hontut leh a sisan a pawtsak dia, a sisan leivui in a vuk ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sa tengteng hinna thu ah a sisan leh a hinna kibang geih ahi. Huaiziak in, Israel suante kiang ah, sa sisan mawngmawng na ne ding uh ahi kei, sa tengteng hinna a sisan ahi ngal a. Kuapeuh hiai na satkhiat ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah sih a si hiam, sa keih lup hiam ne mi, huai gam a mi hiam leng hi hen aw, a puan uh a sawp ding ua, a kisil ding uh ahi. Nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi ding uh. Huchi in nitaklam in a hong siangta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sawpkei ua, a kisil kei uleh a thulimlouhna mawh a kipuak ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, Kei Toupa , na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na omna masa uh Aigupta gam mite hihbang in hihkei unla, k’on pilutna ding Kanaan gam mite hihbang in leng hihkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka vaihawmte na zui ding ua, ka dante zui in na mang ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka dan leh ka vaihawmte na mang ding uh ahi, huai mi’n ahihleh a hing ding hi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuamah in na tanau nai numei, a vuaktanna lem ding in na zuan ding ahi kei. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pa vuaktanna ahihkeileh na nu vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. Na nu ahi a, a vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pa zi vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei, na pa vuaktanna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sanggamnu, na pa tanu hiam na nu tanu hiam, na pianpih hiam, na pianpih louh hiam vuaktanna leng na lem ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tapa tanu hiam, na tanu, tanu hiam vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. A vuaktanna uh nang vuaktanna ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na pa zi tanu, na pa suan vuaktanna, na sanggamnu ahi, a vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na pa sanggamnu vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. Na pa tanaunu nai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nu sanggamnu vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei, na nu tanau nu nai ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa sanggam vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei, a zi na zuan ding ahi kei, na nu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na mounu vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. Na tapa zi ahi a, a vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sanggampa zi vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. Na sanggampa vuaktanna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nutate vuaktanna na lem ding uh ahi kei. A vuaktanna lem ding in a tapa tanu hiam, a tanu-tanu hiam na la ding ahi kei. Na tanau naite ahi ua; gitlouhna lianpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na zi a damlai teng, a sanggamnu, a vuaktanna lem ding in na zi in na nei ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei a nitdan ngeina a, a nit sung in a vuaktannna lem ding in na zuan ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lak a kihihnin ding in na invengpa zi na luppih ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Molech adia mei a lutsuak sak ding in na gil a gah himhim na pe ding ahi kei, na Pathian min na hihse ding ahi sam kei. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Numei bang in pasal na luppih ding ahi kei. Thil kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kihihnin ding in ganta himhim na luppih ding ahi kei. Luppih ding in ganta ma ah numei adin ding ahi kei. Gitlouhna tungtuan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiaite ah, a bangmah ah kihihnin kei un. Hiai thil tengteng ah na ma ua ka delhkhiak khitsa namte a na nin khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A gam leng a nin khinta hi. Huaiziak in, a thulimlouhnate uh ziak in amau ka gawt a, gam in asung a tengmite a lawkhe khin vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in, nou zaw ka dante, ka vaihawmte na zui ding uh ahi. Hiai thil kihhuaite na hih ding uh ahi kei, na gam ua mi himhim hiam, gamdangmi na lak ua tengte hiam in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai thil kihhuai tengteng na ma ua hiai gam a omte’n a na hih khin ua, gam mah leng a nin khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ma ua om nam a lawkhia mah bang in na hihnit ua gam in a hon luakkhiat louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kuapeuh hiai thilkihhuaite lak a khatpeuh hihmi a chipihte apan satkhiat ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in, hiai thilkihhuai na ma ua omte’n a chin bang uh na chin samlouhna ding un leh huai a na ki hihnit louhna ding un ka thupiak na zui ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suan mipite tengteng houpih inla, a kiang uah: Na siangthou ding uh ahi, Kei, Toupa na Pathian uh ka siangthou ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Michih in na nu leh na pa na lau ding uh ahi. Ka khawlnite na tan ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa Na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milim lam ah kihei kei unla, sunthoh milim pathiante leng kibawltawm kei un. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa adia kilemna thillat na lat chiang un noumau deihtelna a na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lat ni mah uh ahihkeileh a zing a na nekding uh ahi. A ni thum ni tan a, a val a omlai leh mei a na hal ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni thum ni a kinek leh thilkihhuai ahi a; pomsak ahi kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ne kuapeuh in Toupa thil siangthou a hihnit ziak in a thulimlouhna mawh a kipuak dia, huai mi a chipihte apan satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lou ua buh na lak chiang un, lounawl zulte tan in na lavek ding uh ahi kei. A sang leng na zong ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na grephuan uah a sang na zong ding uh ahi kei. Na grephuan ua a gah kia leng na tomkhawm ding uh ahi kei. Mi zawng leh gamdangmi ading in na hawisak ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na gu ding uh ahi kei. A taklou in thil na hih ding ahi kei. Zuau na kihilh tuah ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na Pathian min hemsak ding in ka min in dikloutakin na kichiam ding uh ahi kei. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na invengte na khem ding ahi kei. Na guk sak ding leng ahi kei. Kilohmi loh zankhua in a zingsang tan in na kem ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangong na hamsiat ding ahi kei. Mittaw ma ah a pukna ding na koih ding ahi kei. Na Pathian na lauh ding ahi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihawmna ah diktatlou tak in thu na khen ding ahi kei. Mi zawng na simmawh tuam ding ahi kei hi. Mi thilhihthei na zahtak tuam ding ahi kei. Himahleh diktattak in na invengte vai na hawm sak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na chipihte lak ah migensia in na vialvak ding ahi kei. Na invengte sisan thu ah a hilou lam in na pang ding ahi kei. Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungtang in na unau na haw ding ahi kei. Na invengte na taihilh ngeingei ding ahi. Na huchih leh a gitlouhna ah na siang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Phu na la ding ahi kei. Na chipihte suante huatna na pai ding ahi kei. Nang na ki-it bang in na invengte na it ding ahi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thupiakte na zui ding uh ahi. Na ganta chi tuamtuam suangsak ken. Na lou ah haichi chi nih chingkhawm ken. Thil chituam nih gatpolh puan na silh ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kuapeuh sikhanu, a pasal ding khamsa nei, tat nailouh, khahkhiak nailouh numei toh lumkhawm peuhmah gawt ding ahi. Himahleh hihlup ding bel ahi kei, amah zalen ahihlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin kongpi bul ah Toupa kiang ah a tatlekna thoihna ding in belampa a honkaih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thil hihkhelhsa, a khelhna ah Toupa ma ah tatlek thoihna belampa in siampu in kilemna a bawlsak dia; huchi in a thil hihkhelhsa ngaihdam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gam na valuah ua, nek dia theikung chichih na suan hun un a gah sianglou in na ngai ding uh. Nou ading in kum thum sianglou a ngaih ding ahi a, nek hetlouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh, a kum lina ah a gah teng Toupa phatna ding in amah adia sehtuam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kum ngana ah nou adia a punzel theihna ding in a gah na ne ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sisan toh khat peuh na ne ding uh ahi kei. Bum ching in ai nasan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na baknel apan a kimvel in na lu na met ding ahi kei. Na khamul langtuak leng na tan ding ahi sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Misi ziak in na sa uh na atkeh ding uh ahi kei. Na satung ua gelh in chiamtehna na gelh ding uh ahi kei. Kei, Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tanu kizuak sak ken. Gam angkawmna gam a hongsuak kha dia, gitlouhna in a hong dim kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka Sabbathte na tan ding uh ahi. Ka Mun Siangthou na zahtak ding uh ahi. Kei, Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dawi aisansiamte zuan kei unla, bumsiamte leng a hon nitsak louhna ding un zongkhe kei un. Kei, Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lu a kelsam poute ma ah ding in. Tek omna na zahtak in. Na Pathian lau in. Kei, Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gamdangmi, na gam ua a na tengsam a om leh na hihsiatlouh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gamdangmi na lak ua tengte bel nou a din na gam ua mi bang ahi ding ua, nangmah na ki-it bang in amah na it ding ahi. Nou leng Aigupta gam ah gamdangmi na hi ngeita uhi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vaihawm thu ah, tehna chiang ah, gikdan ah leh saudan tehna ah diktatloupi in na hih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bukna dik, gikdan dik, ephah dik, hindik na nei ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh Aigupta gam apan nou hon pikhepa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thupiak tengteng leh ka vaihawm tengteng na pom ding ua, na zuih ding uh ahi. Kei, Toupa ka hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah, Kuapeuh, Israel suante lak a mi hiam, Israel gam a teng gamdangmi hiam, a gil a gah Molech pe peuhmah hihlup ngeingei ding ahi. Hiai gam a miteng in suang in a denglum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Mun Siangthou leh ka min siangthou hihnin ding a, a gilgah khenkhat Molech kiang a a piak ziak in huai mi tung ah ka mai ka gumsak dia, a chipihte lak apan ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai gam a mite’n a gil a gah Molech kiang a piak a kitheihmohbawl ua, a hihlup kei uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amah leh a inkawte tung ah ka mai ka gumsak dia, Molech kiang a kei hon angkawm san peuhmahte toh a chipihte uh lak apan ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lak ua angkawm dia dawi aisansiamte leh bumsiamte zuan mi tung ah ka mai ka gumsak dia; a chipihte lak apan ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, kihihsiangthou unla, siangthou in om un. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thupiakte pom in na zui ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa nou honhih siangthoupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nu hiam, a pa hiam hamsiat khum peuhmah hihlup ngeingei ding ahi. A nu hiam, a pa hiam hamsiat khum ahi a, a tung ah a sisan mawh a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi zi angkawm, a invengte zi angkawm zaw, a angkawmpa leh a angkawmnu, a nih ua hihlup ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pa zi luppih in a pa vuaktanna lem ahi a; hihlup tuaktuak ding ahi. A sisan mawh a tung uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi’n a mounu a luppih leh hihlup tuaktuak ding ahi. Tatsiatna tungtuan hih ahi ua, a sisan mawh a tung uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi’n numei a luppih bang a pasal a luppih leh thil kihhuai mahmah hihtuak ahi ua, hihlup ngeingei ding ahi. A sisan mawh a tung uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi’n nuta zi in nei leh gitlouhna ahi. Na lak ua thulimlouhna a omlouhna ding in amah leh nutate mei a hallup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi’n ganta a luppih leh hihlup ngeingei ding ahi. Ganta leng hihlup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Numei in ganta a va naih a, a kiluppih sakleh huai numei na hihlup ngeingei ding uh ahi. Ganta leng hihlup ngeingei ding ahi a; a sisan mawh a tung uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi’n a sanggamnu, a pa tanu hiam, a nu tanu hiam a kitenpih a, a vuaktanna a muh a, aman leng a vuaktanna a muh leh thil gilou hih ahi ua, a mite mitmuh a satkhiat ding ahi uh. A sanggamnu vuaktanna lem ahi a, a tatlekna mawh a paw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi’n numei a kha teng sineih a neih lai a, a luppih a, a vuaktanna a lem leh a si pawtna lem ahi a, aman leng a si pawtna lem ahi a, a chipihte ua pan a nih ua satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nu sanggamnu hiam, na pa sangnu hiam vuaktanna na lem ding ahi kei. A sanggam nai vuaktanna lem ahi a, a gitlouhna mawh a paw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi’n a pangak zi a luppih leh a pangak vuaktanna lem ahi a; a khelh mawh uh a paw ding ua, suanlehpak bei in a si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi’n a unaupa zi a kitenpih leh thilnin ahi a, a unaupa vuaktanna lem ahi a, suanlehpak neilou in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka thupiak tengteng, ka vaihawm tengteng na pom ding ua, na zui ding uh ahi. Huchi in tenna dia k’on pina gam in nou a hon lawkhe kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ma ua ka delhkhiaksa namdangte thilhihte na zui ding uh ahi kei. Hiai thil tengteng a hih ua, huaiziak in, amau ka kih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh nou kiang ah, a gam uh, nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam na luah ding un k’on pe ding, ka chi khinta hi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh, namdangte apan hon hihtuampa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in, sa siang leh sianglou leh vasa siang leh sianglou na khen tuam ding ua; sa hiam, vasa hiam lei a vak thoh chi himhim hiam nou adia sianglou dia ka sehtuamte in na hinna uh na kihhuai sak ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei ading in Mi Siangthou na hi ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa lah ka siangthou ngal a. Kei a na hihna ding un namdangte lak apan nou k’on septuamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pasal leng, numei leng dawi aisansiam zawl hiam, bumsiam hiam hihlup ngeingei ding ahi a; suang a denlup ding ahi uh. A sisan mawh uh a tung uah a om ding hi, a chi nawn lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah: Aron tapa siampute houpih inla, a kiang uah: a chipihte uh lak a misi ziak in kuamah a kihihnin ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tanau nai, a nu uh, a pa uh, a tapa uh, a tanu uh, a unau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a sanggamnu, a ompih lai uh nungak, pasal nei nailoute ziak in ahihleh a ki hihnin thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai bang ahihkei ngal leh, a chipihte uh lak a intekpen a hih ziak in a kihihnin ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lu uh a metgiau ding uh ahi kei. A khamul siktuak uh leng a tan tom ding uh ahi kei. A sa uh leng a atkeh ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A Pathian uh ading in Mi Siangthou ahi ding ua, a Pathian min a hemsak ding ahi kei hi. Toupa adia mei a thillat, a Pathian adia nekding ansiahte a lat ziak in a siangthou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Numei kizuak hiam, min hem hiam, a pasal maksa hiam a kitenpih ding ahi kei, a Pathian ading in Mi Siangthou ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in, amah na siangthousak ding ahi; aman na Pathian tanghou a lat ziak in, nang ading in a siangthou ding hi. Kei, Toupa , nou honhih siangthoupa lah ka siangthou ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />siampu kuapeuh tanu kizuak a, a kihih thanghuai leh a pa a hih thanghuai ahi a, mei a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A unaute lak a siampu lianpen, a lu sathau nilhsa, puansilh dia sehtuamsa in a lukhuhna a lakhe ding ahi kei. A puante a botkek ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misi luang omna ah a lut ding ahi kei. A nu hiam, a pa hiam ziak in a kihihnin ding ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mun siangthou apan a pawtkhe ding ahi kei. A Pathian Mun Siangthou a hih thanghuai ding ahi sam kei hi. A Pathian sathaunilhna lah a tung ah a om ngal a; Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zi ding in nungak siangthou a kitenpih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meithai hiam, maksa hiam, numei minhem hiam, kizuak hiam a kitenpih ding ahi kei. Amah chipih, nungak siangthou zi ding in a kitenpih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chipihte lak ah a suante a hihnin ding ahi kei. Kei Toupa’n amah ka hihsiangta ngal a, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aron kiang ah, a suante lak a na khang ua demna ding nei peuhmah in a Pathian adia ansiah lan ding in honzuan kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuapeuh melhemna nei in a honnaih hetlouh ding ahi. Mittaw, khebai, nakpek ahihkeileh a kan a val a om peuhmah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihkeileh khe kitan, khut kitan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihkeileh nungkul, mineu lua, mit sia, meima damthei lou nei ahihkeileh chiltang kitam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Siampu Aron suan gensiatna ding nei himhim in Toupa adia mei a thillat lan ding in a honnaih ding ahi kei. Gensiatna ding nei ahi a, a Pathian adia sehtuam an lan dia a honnaih hetlouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A Pathian adia an siangthou leh siangthou pen ahihleh a ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh gensiatna ding nei a hih ziak in puanzak sung ah hiam, maitam kiang nai ah hiam a hongpai theikei ding. Ka mun siangthoute a hihnin kha ding hi. Kei Toupa amah hih siangthoupa ka hi ngal a, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in Aron leh a tapate leh Israel suante tengteng kiang ah a genta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate kiang ah gen inla, Israel suante’n ka ma a thillat siangthou, kei adia sehtuam a latte uh zahtak tak in sai uhen. Ka min siangthou a hihnin kha ding uh. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiang uah, khang sawnsawn in na suante uh lak a kuapeuh sianglou a ngaih a om in Toupa adia sehtuam a om thillat siangthou a naih leh ka omna apan satkhiat in a om ding. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aron suan kuapeuh phak hiam, thilpawt nei hiam in a sian masiah thil siangthoute nekei hen. Misi in a hihnit hiam, amah apan chipawt peuhmah hiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahihkeileh amah sianglou hisak thei bokvak ganhing khatpeuh khoihkha hiam bangchibang sianglou khoihkha sianglou in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchibang khoihmi nitaklam tan in sianglou ahi dia, tui a a kisil kei leh thil siangthoute a nek louh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nitum chiang in a hong siangta ding hi. Huaikhit in thilsiangthoute a netheita ding, a nekding an a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kihihnin ding in amah sih a si hiam, gamsa in a balnen hiam a ne ding ahi kei. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka thupiak a zuih ding ahi. Huchilou in zaw a kihihnitna khelh mawh a kipuak ding a, a sihloh ding hi. Kei Toupa , amaute hih siangthoupa ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdang mi’n thil siangthou a ne ding ahi kei. Siampu kiang a gamta hiam, kiloh hiam in thil siangthou a ne ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh siampu in kuahiam sum a a lei leh, huai mi in bel a ne thei dia, a inn a piangte’n leng a ne thei sam ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siampu tanu in gamdang mi a kitenpih leh thillat siangthoute a ne ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh siampu tanu in ta neilou in meithai in hiam, mak hiam a om a, a pa inn a, a kiknawn leh a nungak laimah bang in a pa nek dingte a nesam ding hi. Himahleh gamdang mi in a ne ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi’n theilou a thil siangthou a nek leh amun nga a khen, mun khat a koih behlap dia, thil siangthou pen siampu kiang ah a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel suante’n Toupa kiang a a lat uh thil siangthou a thangbawl ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihkeileh, hiai thil siangthoute ne in a tatlekna uh mawh a kipuak ding uh, hiaite kei Toupa’n ka hih siangthouta ngal a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate leh Israel inn kaw tengteng houpih inla, a kiang uah, Israel lak a teng, gamdang mi hiam, kuapeuh a thillat uh, haltum thillat dia Toupa kiang a a lat uh, a thuchiamna uh hiam, amah ut thu a thillat hiam lan peuhmahte’n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Santak na hihtheihna ding un bawng hiam, belam hiam, kel hiam, a pa gensiatbei na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gensiat kai himhim na lat ding uh ahi kei. Hon pomsak theih lah ahi ngalkei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kuapeuh thuchiam hih buching ding hiam, amah utthua a thillat ding hiam, lemna thillat kithoihna a ganhon lak a hiam, a belamhon lak a hiam, Toupa kiang a lan taphot in, pomtak a hih theihna ding in gensiatbei a lat ding ahi a; gensiat kaina himhim a om ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mittaw, a guh tan, a khebai, meima nei, chibawk leh phak nei, Toupa kiang a na lat ding uh ahi kei, mei a thillat ding in Toupa kiang ah maitam ah na lan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah ut thu a thillat ding in bawngpa hiam, belamnou hiam, a kan a val a om sahiang nei hiam, sahiang kimlou hiam bel na lan thei ding uh. Himahleh thuchiamna thillat ding in hiaite pom ahi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A chiltang dup hiam, kitam hiam, keh hiam Toupa kiang ah na lan ding uh ahi kei. Na gam uah huchibang kithoihna ding in na zang ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gamdang mi apan la in huaite lak a himhim na Pathian uh adia sehtuam an ding in na lan ding uh ahi kei. A siatna leh gensiat kaina a om ziak in pomsak theih ahi kei ding hi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawngpa hiam, belam hiam, kel hiam, a hongpian chiang in a pi kiang ah ni sagih a om ding ahi, a ni giat ni apan a nunglam in Toupa adia mei a thillat ding in pomtheih ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawngpi hiam, belampi hiam, a nou toh ni khat in na gou ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kipahthu genna kithoihna dia Toupa kiang a na kithoih chiang un pomtak na hih theihna ding un na kithoih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai ni mah a nekbei ding ahi, a zingchiang tan in bangmah na sit ding uh ahi kei. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka thupiakte na pom ding ua, na zuih ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka min siangthou na hemsak ding uh ahi kei. Israel suante lak ah hihsiangthou in ka om ding ahi. Kei noute honhih siangthoupa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />na Pathian uh hidia Aigupta gam apan hon pikhepa ka hi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah: Toupa Ankuanglui hunbi hiaite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni guk sung nna nasem ding ua, a ni sagih ni khawlna Sabbath ahi a, khawmpi siangthou ahi. Hiai ni’n nna nasem ding uh ahi kei. Na tenna teng uah hiai Toupa Sabbath ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa Ankuanglui hunbi, khawmpi siangthou, a hun geihgeih a na phuan ding uh hiaite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kha khatna, ni sawmlehli nitaklam in Toupa Paikan Ankuang a kipan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai kha mah ni sawmlehnga Toupa adia silngou sohlouh tanghou Ankuang ahi a, ni sagih sung silngou sohlouh tanghou na ne ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ni khat ni’n khawmpi siangthou na nei ding ua, nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni sagih sung mei a thillat Toupa kiang ah na lan ding ua; a ni sagih ni pen khawmpi siangthou ahi a, nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei, chi’n, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, K’on gam piak ding na vatun ua, huai a buh na lak chiang un, na buh thak masate uh phal khat siampu kiang a n’on tawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pomsak theih na hihna ding un, aman buhphal pen Toupa ma ah a hon na veisak dia; khawlni zingchiang in siampu in a vei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Buhphal na vei ni un belamnoupa, gensiatbei, kum khat a upa haltum thillat ding in Toupa kiang ah na lan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangbuang thillat bel tangbuang nel chi ephah mun sawm a khen, mun nih sathau a mek, Toupa adia gimlim, mei a thillat ahi ding ahi. Dawn thillat ahihleh uain hin mun li a khen, mun khat ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na Pathian uh adia thillat na lat ma un, huai ma himhim in tanghou hiam, kan thoh hiam, an thak hitaleh na ne ding uh ahi kei. Hiai na tenna teng ua na suante zel uh tan a na tangtawn dan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabbath zing chiang vei thillat buhphal n’on tawi ni ua pan in na sim ding ua, khawlni sagihvei a ching ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawlni sagihveina zingsang apan ni sawmnga na sim ding ua, Toupa kiang a tangbuang thak thillat na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tenna mun ua pan in ephah mun sawm a khen, mun nih a bawl, tanghou beu vei ding nih, tangbuang nel chi, silngou toh kan, Toupa adia gah masa vei thillat a lat dia na hontawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tanghou lat toh kituak in belamnou sagih gensiatbei, kum khat a upa leh bawngtuai leh belampa nih na lan ding uh ahi. Huaite a tangbuang thillat uh leh a dawn thillat u toh, Toupa adia haltum thillat, Toupa adia gimlim, mei a thillat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khelh thoihna ding in kelpa khat leh kilemna thillat kithoihna ding in belamnou a pa nih kum khat a upa na lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siampu in gah masa a bawl tanghou, belamnou nih toh Toupa ma a vei thillat in a vei dia; siampu a tuam, Toupa adia siangthou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ni mah na sep ding ua, nou ading in khawmpi siangthou ahi dia, nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei. Hiai na tenna teng uah na suante uh tan in tangtawn dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lou ua buh na lak chiang un na lounawl zul uh lavek kei un. A sang leng na zong ding uh ahi kei. Mizawng leh gamdang mi adia na hawi sak ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, a kha sagihna huai kha ni khat ni nou ading in khawlna ni ahi dia; pengkul mut in theihgigena khawmpi siangthou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei; Toupa adia mei a thillat na lan ding uh, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kha sagihna ni sawm ni Kilemna Ni ahi a; nou ading in khawmpi siangthou ahi ding. Na lungsimte uh zangsak unla, Toupa ading in mei a thillat lan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai ni’n bang napeuh na sem ding uh ahi kei. Toupa na Pathian uh ma a lemna bawlsak ding, Kilemna ni lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huai ni kizang saklou peuhmah, a mite apan satkhiat ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kuapeuh hi hen aw, huai ni a bang nna peuh sem, a chipihte uh lak apan ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bang nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei. Hiai bel na tenna peuh ua na suante zel uh tan a tangtawn dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nou ading in khawlna Sabbath ahi a; na kizang sak ding uh ahi. Huai kha ni kua ni nitaklam, huai kha nitaklam apan nitaklam nawn tan khawlni’n na zang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, a kha sagihna ni sawmlehnga Toupa ading in ni sagih sung Bawkta Ankuang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ni khatna pen khawmpi siangthou ahi dia, nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni sagih sung in mei a thillat Toupa kiang ah na lan ding ua, a ni giat ni nou ading in khawmpi siangthou ahi ding. Mei a thillat Toupa kiang ah na lan ding ua; khawmpi bei ni ahi a, nna himhim na sem ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hiaite ahi, Toupa Ankuangluina hunbi, Toupa adia mei a thillat, haltum thillat, tangbuang thillat, kithoihna, dawn thillat, a ni tuam chiat a lan dia khawmpi siangthou na zat dingte uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Toupa khawlnite, na thilpiakte uh, na thuchiam tengteng uh, amah ut thu a thillat, Toupa kiang a na thillat zelte uh ban ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kha sagihna ni sawmlehnga ni a na lou ua thilpiangte na lak khit chiang un Toupa Ankuangluina ni sagih na zang ding ua; a ni khatna ni khawl kinken na ni ahi dia, a ni giat ni leng khawl kinken na mah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A ni khat ni’n singkung hoihte gahte, tumsing hiangte, singbawkpha hiangte, lui a muisumte na tawi ding ua, Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah ni sagih sung kipak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hiai Ankuangluina bel Toupa adia kum chih a ni sagih sung na zat ding uh ahi. Hiai na suante uh zel tan a tangtawn dan ding ahi. A kha sagihna a na zatzel ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sawlbuk ah ni sagih sung na teng ding ua, Israelmi a piang himhim sawlbuk ah na tenvek ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi in na suante un Israel suante Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak lai in sawlbuk ah ka tengsak, chih a thei ding uh. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in Toupa Ankuangluina hunbite Israel suante kiang ah a phuangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante, Olive thau chimtak, det ding a suk, khawnvak kuansak gige nadia na kiang a hontawi ding in thupia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin a thu theihpihna puanzak pawlam ah nitaklam apan zinglam tan ading in Toupa ma ah Aron in koihhoih hen. Hiai na suante zel uh tan a tangtawn dan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa ma ah khawnvak koihna siangthoutak tung ah khawnvakte koihhoih zel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangbuang nel chi la inla, tanghou sawmlehnih in bawl in. Tanghou khat a ephah mun sawm a khen mun nih zat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa ma ah dohkan siangthou tung ah vual nih in, vual khat a guk tuaktuak in na chiang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tanghou tung a a vual nih ah begaw chimtak na koih dia, theihgigena, Toupa adia mei a thillat a hong hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawlni teng in Toupa ma ah a koihhoih zel ding ahi. Hiai tangtawn thukhun, Israel suante ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai Aron leh a tapate a tuam ahi dia, Mun Siangthou ah a ne ding uh. Tangtawn dan ding a Toupa adia mei a thillatte lak a, amah adia thil siangthoutak ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel numei tapa, a pa Aigupta mi khat Israel suante lak ah a vahoh a; huai Israel numei tapa leh Israelmi khat giahmun ah a kisual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel numei tapa in Pathian min gensia in a hamsiat khum a; huchi in Mosi kiang ah a honpi uh. A nu min Selomith ahi a, Dan chi Dibri tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa kam apan thupawt ngakna in suangkulh ah a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hamsiat loupa giahphual pawlam ah pi khia unla, a theihpihte tengteng in a lu ah a khut uh nga uhenla, mi tengteng in suang in deng uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, Kuapeuh a Pathian hamsiat loh peuhmah in a khelh mawh a paw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa min gense peuhmah hihlup ngeingei ding ahi. Mi tengteng in suang in a deng ngeingei ding uh ahi. Toupa min a gensiat leh gamdangmi leng, hiai gam a mi him leng hihlup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Si khop a mi tung a khutkha peuhmah hihlup ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Si khop a ganta tung a khutkha peuhmah in a dit ding ahi; ganta sik in ganta mah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min a invengte a melsiat sakleh a hih bang geih a tung a hih sam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Guh kitan sik in guh kitan, mit sik in mit, ha sik in ha; mi a hih melsiat bang in a tung ah leng hihsam ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ganta that peuhmah in a dit ding ahi. Mi that peuhmah hihlup sam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gamdang mite ading leh hiai gam mite ading in dan kibang khat na nei ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, na chi ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in Israel suante a houpih a, hamse loupa giahphual pawlam ah a pikhia ua, suang in a deng uh, Israel suante’n Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Sinai tang ah Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, K’on gam piak ding na va tun chiang un, Toupa min in a gam in leng Sabbath a tang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lou uah kum guk sung thil na ching ding ua, na grephuan kum guk sung na satnou ding ua, a gahte na la ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kum sagih kum in gam khawl kinken na, Toupa min a Sabbath ahi dia: na lou a buh leh bal na chin ding uh ahi kei, na grephuan na satnou ding ahi sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na buhpou na la ding ahi kei, na keplouh grep na lou ding ahi kei. Gam khawl kinken na kum ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam khawl kum a te na nektawm ding uh ahi dia; nang, na sikha leh na sikhanu, na kilohmi, na kiang a teng gamdangmi ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na bawnghon, na gam a ganta adia nektawm ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawl kum, kum sagih na sim dia, kum sagih mun sagih ahi ding a; khawl kum, kum sagih sung kum sawmli leh kua ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaikhit kha sagihna, ni sawm ni’n pengkul ngaihtak in na vialmut sak dia; Kilemna Ni in na gam tengteng uah pengkul na vialmut sak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmngana na kipahpih ding ua, gamsung tengteng ah, huai a tengtengte kiang ah noplenna thu na phuang ding uhi. Nou ading in Jubili ahi dia; michih in noumau a chiat na neinawn ding uh. Michih amah inkuan ah a tengnawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai kum sawmngana pen nou ading in Jubili ahi dia; bangmah na ching kei ding ua, a pou leng na lakei ding ua, keplouh grep gah leng na lou ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jubili a hih ziak in nou ading in siangthou ahi dia, na lou ua thil gahte na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai Jubili kum in michih kiang ah amah a mah na pe kiknawn ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na invengte kiang a banghiam na khot a, na invengte kiang a banghiam na lei in leng kikhem in kinekna lemtang in na zang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jubili khit a kum zah bangzel in na invengte thil na lei dia, buh leh bal tun kum tamdan dungzui in na kiang ah a zuak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kum tam dan dungzui zel in aman na khangsak dia, a kum tawm dan dungzui in aman na kiamsak ding ahi. Buhlehbal tunkum tam dungzui a na kiang ah zuak lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kikhem ding uh ahi kei. Na Pathian na lau ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka thusehte zui in ka vaihawmte na pom ding uh ahi. Huchi in huai gam ah bittak in na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gam in gah a suah dia, niang leh tai a ne in na ta ding ua, bittak in na vateng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihleh, a kum sagih kum in bang ka neta ding ua? Ngai dih, bangmah lah ka ching kei ua, ka thil tungte uh lah ka la sam kei ua, na chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kum guk kum in ka vualzawlna na tung ua tung ding in thu ka pedia, kum thum sung ading gah a suah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kum giat kum in buh na ching ding ua, haichi na pawi sung un buh luite na ne ding ua, kum kua kum tan, a hongthak nawn matan in a luite na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tangtawn a dia gam pen khotden ding ahi kei, gam lah kei a ahi ngal a. Noute mikhual, a khohloh lel na hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na gamluah tengteng uh, tatkik na phal ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na unau a hong gentheih a, a gam khenkhat a zuak leh a tanau naipen a hong kuan dia, a unau gam zuaksa a tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi’n tatsak ding mi neikei mahleh a hong navaka tatna khop a neih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a zuak kum sut henla, a zuaknapa kiang ah a val pe nawn hen; huchi in a gam a luahnawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah adia a tatkiktheih nawn kei leh, a khotsa pen Jubili kum tan in a leipa khut ah om hen. Jubili kum in a pawt nawn dia, aman a gam a luah nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi’n kulhnei khua a tenna inn a zuak leh a zuak apan kum khat sung in a tatnawn theihna hamphatna a nei ding hi. Kum khat sung in a tanthei nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum khat sung a a tattheihkei leh, kulhnei khua a a inn pen tangtawn in a suante zel tan in leng a leimi a ahi den ding ahi, Jubili chiang in leng a pawt tuankei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kulh neilou khua a innte singtang gam bang a ngaih ahi dia, tattheih ahi dia, Jubili chiang in a pawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Himahleh Levimite khua, a tantuam khua ua innte Levimite’n chiklaipeuh in leng a tanthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levi chite lak a mi’n a tat kei leh zuaksa inn leh a tantuan khua pen Jubili chiang in a pawt ding. Levi chite khua a innte Israel suante lak a a tantuan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khokim ua loute zuaktheih ahi kei ding, tangtawn a tantuan uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na unau a hong gentheih a, nang a hong belh leh na kep ding ahi. Mikhual ahihkeileh khualzin bang himahleh amah na kiang ah na tengsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amah apan dangka hiam, thil hiam, a pung laken, himahleh, Pathian lau in, na unau na kiang a a ten theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pung delh in na sum na leitawi sak ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian uh, Kanan gam hon pepa leh na Pathian uh hidia Aigupta gam apan hon pikhepa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na unau a hong gentheih a, na kiang a a hong puklut leh sikha bang a na zat ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kilohmi bang leh na kiang a tengsam bang in na kiang ah a teng dia, Jubili kum tan in nangmah na a sem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huaikhit in na kiang apan a pawt dia, amah leh a tate, amau inkuan ngei ah a lutnawn ding uh, a pi leh pute in leh lou a luahnawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak, ka sikhate ahi ngal ua, sikha dia zuakkhiak ding ahi kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huhamtakin a tung uah gamta kenla; na Pathian lau zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sikhanu leh sikhapa na neih dingte na kim ua nam lak a mi, sikhanu leh sikhapa dia na lei dingte ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na lak ua teng gamdangmi leh na gam ua piang a inkawte uh lak a mite leng na lei theisam ding ua; amau na thilneih a suak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na nung ua na tate uh gouluah ding in, a thilneih ding un na bawl ding uhi. Huai lak a mite na tangtawn sikha ding in na nei ding uh. Himahleh na unau Israel suante lak ah huham tak in na gamtang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Gamdangmi hiam, na kiang ua teng kuahiam hong hau a, a kiang a na unaupa a hong gentheih a, na kiang a gamdangmi hiam, na kiang a teng kiang hiam kiang a amah leh amah a kizuak khiak leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />khotsa ahihnungin leng a kitankik thei ding hi; a unaute lak a khat in amah a tan thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A pangak in hiam, a pangak tapa in hiam a tan thei ding; a chipihte lak a a tanau nai in hiam a tan thei ding hi. Amah leng a hong hauh nawn leh a kitanthei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A puklutnapa toh a puklut apan Jubili kum nawn ding sutkhawm uhenla, a puklut man, a kum omdan in ahi dia; kiloh sikha dia goih sut bangzel a sut sak ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kum tampi a omlai leh a tatna man pen a belh sung hu toh kituak a piak kiknawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jubili kum tunna ding kum tawmchik kia omlai ahihleh sut khawm uhenla; a om kum tam dan dungzui in a tatman a pekik ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kum khat bizel a goih kilohmi bang in a bel ding hi. A belhpa a tung a huhamtak a na gamtat saklouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hiai kumte a tat ahihkeileh, Jubili kum in a pawt ding, amah leh a tate teng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Israel suante lah ka sikhate ahi ngal ua, Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak, ka sikhate ahi uh. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Milimte na kibawl ding uh ahi kei. Milim bawltawm suangphuh na dingsak ding uh ahi kei. Biak ding in na gam uah suang milim na phut ding uh ahi sam kei. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Sabbathte na tang ding ua, ka Mun Siangthou na zahtak ding uh ahi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thusehte na mang ding ua, ka thupiakte pom a na man uleh vuahtui a hunhun in k’on zusak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei in thil a hon piangsak dia, gam a singte’n gah a suang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na phual ua buh in grep loh hun a banpha dia, na grep loh hun un thilchin hun a ban pha ding hi. Na tanghou uh niang leh tai in na ne ding ua, na gam uah bittak in na teng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai gam ah muanna ka omsak dia, na lum ding ua, kuamah in a hon lausak kei ding. Gamsa hoihloute hiai gam apan ka hawlmang dia, namsau in na gam uh a tuansuak sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na melmate uh na delh ding ua, na ma uah namsau a thah in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi nga in za khat na delh ding ua, za khat in sing khat na delh ding uh. Na melmate uh na ma uah namsau a thah in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />K’on deihsak dia, chi tampi k’on suangsak ding hi. Na lak uah ka thukhun ka hihkip ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawtpi na kepsa, a luite na ne ding ua, a thak koihna ding in a luite na lakhe ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lak uah ka biakbuk ka omsak dia; ka hinna in noute a hon kih kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lak uah ka teng dia, na Pathian uh ka hidia, nou leng ka mite na hi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian uh, a sikha uh na hihlouhna ding ua Aigupta gam apan noute hon pikhepa ka hi. Na hakkolte uh ka hihtanta a, ding tang in k’on paisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh ka thu pom lou a, hiai thupiak tengteng na zuih kei ua, ka thusehte na deihkei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />na hinna un ka vaihawmte a huat a, ka thupiak tengteng zui lou a, ka thukhun na bohsiat uleh ken leng na tung uah hiai ka hih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tung uah thil lauhuai, na hinna uh netum leh na mit uh hihsia kumzawnna leh khodam ka lengsak ding hi. Na haichite uh bangmahlou dia ching na hi ding ua, na melmate un a ne zel ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tung uah ka mai ka gumsak dia, na melmate uh ma ah na vuallel ding uh. Nou hon hawte’n na tung uah vai a hawm ding ua, kuamah delhlouh in na tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi pipi a leng ka thu na pom kei lai uleh na khelhnate uh ziak in sagihvei k’on gawt lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thilhihtheihna kiotsakna uh ka hihse dia, na tung ua van sik bang in leh na nuai ua lei sumsan bang in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tha uh na sengthawn lel ding ua; na gam un thil a piangsak kei dia, gam a singte’n gah a suang sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei kalh lam a na om ua, ka thu na pom kei uleh na khelhna uh dungzui in a mun sagih in na tung uah gawtna ka tungsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lak uah gamsate k’on sawl dia, huaite’n na tate uh a hon laksak ding ua, na gantate uh a hih mangthang ding ua, na hong tawm mahmah ding ua, na lampite uh nutsiat in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiaite tawn a k’on bawlhoihna na pom tuankei ua, kei kalh a na omlai lai uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ken leng nou k’on kalh dia, kei mahmah in na khelhnate uh ziak in sagihvei k’on gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in na tung uah namsau ka lengsak dia, huai in ka thukhun na palsat uh phu a la ding hi. Noumau khosung chiat a na kibawm khawm chiang un, na lak uah hi ka lengsak dia, melma khut a piak na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na muan pen uh tanghou ka beisak chiang in, numei sawm in thuk khat ah na tanghou uh a emkhawm ding ua, na tanghou uh buk chitchiat in a honpe ding ua; na ne ding ua, na kham tuankei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi tengteng a leng ka thu na pom kei ua, kei kalh a na om lailai uleh hehtak in noute k’on kalh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na khelhnate uh ziak in sagihvei, kei mahmah in k’on gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na tapate uh sa na ne ding ua, na tanute uh sa na ne nalai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na mun sangte uh ka chimsak dia, na milimte uh ka puksak dia, na luang uh na milimte uh luang tung ah ka pai ding. Ka hinna in nou a hon kih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na khuate uh ka gamsak dia, na mun siangthoute uh ka hawmsak dia, na gimlimte uh ka dik kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gam ka hihse ding a; huai a om na melmate un lamdang a sa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Namdangte lak ah k’on dalhsak dia, nou hon delhzui ding in namsau ka phawi ding. Huchi in na gam uh a hawm dia, na khuate uh a gam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A hawm sungteng leh na melmate uh gam a na om sungteng uh gam in a khawlnite a tang dia, a khawlnite ah nuam a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A hawm sungteng in a khawl ding; asung a na tenlai ua a khawllouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na lak ua mi omsunte, a melmate uh gam ah a lungtang sung uah bahna ka omsak ding hi. Nahthel ging in leng a delh dia, namsau apan taikek bang in a taikek ding ua, kuamah delhlouh in a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kuamah delhlouh in namsau ma a taikek bang in a kipal puk lem lum ding ua; na melmate uh dal ding in hatna himhim na neikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Namdangte lak ah na mangthang ding ua, na melmate gam in nou a hon negai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na lak ua omsunte na melmate uh gam ah a thulimlouhna ziak un, a muih hiaihiai ding ua; a pi leh pute un a thulimlouhnate uh ziak a a muih loh bang un amau leng a muihloh sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka tung a a khelh ziak leh a thulimlouhna uh leh a pi leh pute thulimlouhna leh kei kalh a a om ziak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ken leng amau ka kalh a, a melmate uh gam a ka omsak dante a kitheihmohbawl kei ding ua; a sumlouh lungtang ua a kiniamkhiak ua, a thulimlouhna uh ziak a ka gawtna a pom uh leh, Jakob kiang a ka thukhun ka theigige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isak leh Abraham kiang a ka thukhunte ka theigige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A gam mah leng ka theigige ding hi. Gam in leng a kihep mangsan dia, amau omlou in a hawmsung in a khawlnite ah nuam a sa ding. Ka vaihawmte a deihlouh ziak uh leh a hinna un ka thusehte a muh noplouh nak ziak in, a thulimlouhna uh gawtna a pom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi pipi in leng, a melmate uh gam a a om un amaute ka paimang kei dia, amaute hih mangthang ding leh ka thukhun bohse ding in amaute ka kih kei ding. Kei Toupa a Pathian uh lah ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A Pathian uh ka hih theihna dia namchih mitmuh a Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak, a pipute uh thukhun amaute ziak in ka theigige zaw ding hi. Kei Toupa ka hi, chi’n, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hiaite Sinai tang a Mosi zang a amah leh Israel suante kal a Toupa’n a bawl thupiakte, vaihawmte leh dante ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante houpih inla, a kiang uah, Mi khat in midangte Toupa a tuam dia septuam a lan dia thuchiam a bawl leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal ahihleh na sehdan ding kum sawmnih leh kum sawmguk kikal a upa, Mun Siangthou a sekel buk dungzui in dangka sekel sawmnga hu ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Numei ahihleh na sehdan ding sekel sawmthum ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum nga leh kum sawmnih kikal a upa ahihleh, na sehdan ding pasal, sekel sawmnih, numei, sekel sawm ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kha khat leh kum nga kikal a upa ahihleh, na sehdan ding pasal, dangka sekel nga, numei, sekel thum ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum sawmguk a kipan a tunglam ahihleh, na sehdan ding pasal, sekel sawmlehnga, numei, sekel sawm ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh na sehzah pe zoulou khop a mizawng ahihleh siampu kiang ah a vapai dia, siampu in a nasep ding; thuchiam mi zoh hun bangbang a na sep ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thillat, Toupa kiang a a lat ding uh gan ahihleh kuapeuh in Toupa adia huchibang a piak peuh uh thil siangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hih lamdang ding ahi kei, a hoihpen, a sia in, a siapen a hoih in a kheng ding ahi sam kei. Gan pen gan mah a a khen teitei leh a nih in a siangthou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gan sianglou, Toupa kiang a lat ngeilouh chi ahihleh, gan pen siampu ma a koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siampu in a hoih dan bang in a man hun a na sep ding. Siampu in a seh bangbang ahi zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh a tat nawn taktak ding leh na sehzah mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi’n a inn Toupa a tuam dia a lat ding leh a hoih leh hoih louh dungzui in siampu in a sep dia; siampu seh bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lan mi in a inn pen a tatnawn ding leh aman ding a na seh zah mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap ding hi. Huchi in amah a ahi nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi’n a gam a lou a khen Toupa a tuam dia a lat ding leh na seh dan ding a chi tuh dungzui zel in ahi ding. Barli buh homer khat mun, dangka sekel sawmnga man ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lou pen Jubili kum apan lat ahihleh na seh bang ahi toupek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jubili kum nung a lat ahihleh bel siampu in Jubili tun nawnna ding kum dungzui zel in aman a sep dia, na seh dan apan a kiam hun bawl ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lan mi in a tatnawn taktak ding leh aman na sehzah mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap dia, amah a ahi nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lou pen a tat noplouh hiam, midang kiang a khot hiam ahihleh tatnawn theih ahi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jubili kum a a pawtnawn hun in loupen Toupa adia siangthou, amah a tuam siangthou ahi dia siampu a ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah lou him hilou, a leisa lou, mi’n Toupa kiang a a lat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jubili kum tan in na seh dan bang in siampu in a man a seh sak dia, na seh bang in Toupa adia siangthou hi ding in huai ni’n a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jubili kum in a leinapa, a gamneipa mah in a tang nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na sehdan tengteng Mun Siangthou sekel bangzel ahi dia, gerah sawmnih sekel khat ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ganta lak a piang masapen, a pian masak pen ziak a Toupa a tuam dia sehsa peuhmah kuamah in a lan ding ahi kei. Bawngtal leng belam leng hitaleh, Toupa a tuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gan sianglou ahihleh na seh dan bang a tat ding ahi dia, a mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap ding hi. Tat ahihkeileh, na seh dan bang a khot ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi’n a neih lak a bangpeuh, mihing hi in, ganta hiam, a neihsa lou hitaleh, Toupa kiang a a piaksa zuak ding ahi kei a, tat ding leng ahi kei. Huai thil chih Toupa adia siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kuapeuh si dia vaihawmsak, mihing lak apan manthatsak ding, tat ding ahi kei, amah sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gam sung a sawm a khat peuhmah, gamsung a haichi hitaleh, sing gah hitaleh, Toupa a ahi. Toupa adia thil siangthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi’n a sawm a khat a tat nop leh, mun nga a khen, mun khat a behlap ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawng leh belam sawm a khat thu ah, ganvulmi chiang a chiamtehsa nangawn leng, a sawmna zel Toupa adia siangthou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai gan hoih hia, hoihlou, a enchian ding ahi kei, a khek ding leng ahi sam kei. A khek leh, a khek pen leh a khekna pen leng a nih un siangthou ahi ding ua; tat ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hiaite Israel suante adia Toupa’n Sinai tang a Mosi kiang a thupiakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
